<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">John</book>
  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc1">John</para>
  <para style="toc2">John</para>
  <para style="mt">John</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tîrin Thu a awm, Thu chu Pathian hnênah a awm, Thu chu Pathian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chu mi chu a tîrin Pathian hnênah a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Engkim a zain ama siam a ni; thilsiam zawng zawng hi ama siam loh eng mah a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amahah chuan nunna a awm; chu nunna chu mihringte ênna a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Êng chu thim zîngah a lo êng a; thimin chu chu a hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian tirh mi pakhat a lo awm a, a hming chu Johana a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu mi chu hriattîr tûrin a lo kal a, êng thu chu hriattîr tûrin; amah avânga mi zawng zawngin an rinna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chu êng chu a ni lo, êng thu chu hriattîr tûra lo kal a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Êng tak, mi tin tiêng ṭhîn kha a awm a, khawvêlah a lo kal mêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chu khawvêlah a awm, khawvêl ama siam a ni, khawvêlin amah a hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama mite hnênah a lo kal a, ama miten an lo lâwm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, amah lâwm apiang chu, an hnênah Pathian fate nih theihna tûr a pe, a hming ringtute chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />chûng mite chu thisen hrin an ni lo va, tisa duh zâwnga hrin an ni hek lo, mipa duh zâwng pawha hrin an ni hek lo, Pathian hrin an ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Thu chu tisaah a lo chang a, kan zîngah a awm ta a (Pa fa mal neih ropui angin a ropuizia kan hmu), khawngaih leh thutakin a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Johanan a thu a hriattîr a, a au va, “ ‘Ka hnunga mi zui tûr khân mi lehkhalh tawh a ni, ka hmaa awm tawh reng a nih avângin,’ tia a thu ka sawi kha amah hi a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A famkimna kan chang ṭheuh, khawngaih chunga khawngaih lehchhâwnna nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dân thu Mosian a pe, khawngaihna leh thutak Isua Krista avângin a lo awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu mân eng lai mahin Pathian an hmu lo, a Fapa mal neih, Pa ângchhûnga awm ngei khân a chanchin a hril tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Juda-ten, “Tu nge i nih?” tia zâwt tûra Jerusalem khua ata a hnêna puithiamte leh Levia chia mite an tirh lai khân, hêng hi Johana thu lo hriattîr chu a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ṭang lovin a inpuang a, “Krista chu ka ni lo ve,” tiin a inpuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Tu nge i nih le? Elija i ni em?” an ti a, an zâwt a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ka ni lo ve,” a ti a. “Zâwlnei kha i ni em?” an ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ni lo ve,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “A nih leh, tu nge i nih? Min tîrtute kan chhân theih nân min hrilh ta che. I chanchin rêng eng nge i sawi dâwn?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “ ‘Lalpa kalkawng tirual rawh u,’ tia thlalêra autu aw ka ni, zâwlnei Isaia sawi ang khân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An mi tirhate chu Pharisaite hnêna mi an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Krista tal, Elija tal, zâwlnei tal chu i nih si loh chuan engati nge i baptis ṭhin le?” an ti a, an zâwt leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Johanan an hnênah, “Keiin tuiin ka baptis ṭhîn, in zîngah mi pakhat in hriat loh a ding a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ani chu ka hnua lo kal tûr chu a ni a, a pheikhawk hrui phelh tlâk pawh ka ni lo ve,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng thil chu Jordan râla Bethani khuaah, Johana baptisnaah khân an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan Johanan Isua a hnênah lo kal dâwnin a hmu a. Tin, a sawi a, “En teh u, Pathian Berâmno, khawvêl sual kalpuitu tûr saw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Saw mi saw a ni, ‘Mi pakhat mi lehkhalh khân mi zui dâwn, ka hmaa awm sa rêng a ni,’ ka tiha kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amah chu ka lo hre si lo; nimahsela, Israel-ten amah an hriat theih nân, tuia baptis-in ka lo kal a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Johanan a thu a hriattîr a, a sawi a, “Thlarau chu ṭhuro angin vân aṭanga chhuk ka hmu a, a chungah a fu reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amah chu ka hre si lo va; nimahsela, tuia baptis tûra mi tîrtu khân ka hnênah, ‘Tu chungah pawh Thlarau zuk fua, a chunga awm reng i hmuh apiang, amah chu Thlarau Thianghlima baptistu tûr chu a ni ang,’ mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chu chu ka hmu tawh a, he mi hi Pathian Fapa a ni tih ka hriattîr tawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, a tûk lehah Johana a ding a, zirtîrte pahnih nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />tin, Isua veivâk lai a en a, “En teh u, Pathian Berâmno saw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte pahnih chuan a thusawi chu an hria a, Isua an zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu a hawi a, an rawn zui a hmu a, an hnênah, “Eng nge in zawn?” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan, “Rabbi (Chu chu Zirtîrtu tihna a ni), khawiah nge i awm?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Anin an hnênah, “Lo kal ula, in hmu ang,” a ti a. Chutichuan, an kal a, a awmna chu an hmu a, chumi ni chuan a hnênah an awm reng a; zanriah chhum hun lai a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Johana thusawi chu hriaa Isua zuitute pahnih chu, a pakhat zâwk chu Andria, Simon Petera unau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ani chuan a hmasa berin ama unau Simona a hmu a, a hnênah, “Messia kan hmu ta,” a ti a (chu chu Krista tihna a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tichuan, Isua hnênah a rawn hruai a. Isuan ani chu a lo en a, “Johana fapa Simona i ni, Kipha an vuah ang che,” a ti a (chu chu Petera tihna a ni).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, a tûkah chuan Isua chuan Galili rama kal a tum a, Philipa a hmu a, a hnênah, “Mi zui rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Philipa chu Bethsaida khuaa mi a ni, chu chu Andria leh Petera awmna khua bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Philipa chuan Nathanaela a hmu a, a hnênah, “A chanchin Mosian Dân Lehkhabua a ziak leh zâwlneiten an ziak kha, amah chu kan hmu ta, Nazareth Isua, Josefa fapa chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Nathanaela chuan a hnênah, “Nazareth khuaah thil ṭha a chhuak thei em ni?” a ti a. Philipa chuan a hnênah, “Lo kal la, en rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Isuan Nathanaela a hnêna lo kal dâwnin a hmu a, a chanchin a lo sawi a, “En teh u, Israel mi tak, ngamthlêmna rêng nei lo saw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Nathanaela chuan a hnênah, “Nangin engtin nge mi hriat?” a ti a. Isuan a hnênah, “Philipan a koh hma chea, theipui bula i awm lai khân ka hmu che asin,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Nathanaelan a hnênah, “Rabbi, Pathian Fapa i ni, Israel-te Lalber i nih hi,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “ ‘Theipui bulah ka hmu che asin,’ i hnêna ka tih avângin i ring a ni maw? Hêng aia thil ropui zâwk hi i la hmu ang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, Isua vêkin a hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, vân inhawngah, Pathian vântirhkohte Mihring Fapa chungah hian chhuk leh chho in la hmu ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ni thum nîah Galili rama Kana khuaah lawi chaw a awm a, chutah chuan Isua nu a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Isua leh a zirtîrte pawh lawi chaw eiah an sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, uainin a daih ta lo va, Isua nu chuan a hnênah, “Uain an tlachham ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Hmeichhia, nanga mi lo hriatsak tûr eng nge awm? Ka hun a la thleng lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a nu chuan rawngbâwltute hnênah, “In hnêna a sawi apiang chu ti zêl ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te sil fai dân angin lung tuibêl paruk, bûk sawmli hmun hnih emaw, hmun thum emaw leng ṭheuh, chutah chuan an hûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Tuibêlahte tui tikhat rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, a rawng rualin an tikhat ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Tûnah thâl ula, ruaiṭheh fatu hnênah kalpui rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, an kalpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ruaiṭheh fatu chuan tui uaina lo chang ta chu a tem a, a chhuahna chin a hre lo va (tui thâl rawngbâwltute erawh chuan an hria a), nupui nei tûra chu a ko ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a hnênah, “Mi tinin a tîrah uain ṭha an dah chhuak ṭhîn; tin, a tam deuh an in hnuin a ṭha lo deuh chu an dah chhuak ṭhîn; nang zawngin tûn thlengin uain ṭha i la vawn hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isuan he a chhinchhiahna tih ṭan tirhna hi Galili rama Kana khuaah chuan a ti a, a ropuizia a lantîr ta a; tin, a zirtîrte chuan ani chu an ring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan Kapernaum khuaah a zuk kal a, amah leh a nu nên, a unaute nên, a zirtîrte nên; chutah chuan ni rei lo tê an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te Kalhlên Kût a hnai tawh a, Isua chu Jerusalem khuaah a han kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Pathian biak ina sebâwngte, berâmte, ṭhuro zuartuho leh tangka thlengtuho ṭhu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, hruihrualin vuakna a siam a, berâm leh sebâwng chu a zain Pathian biak in aṭang chuan a hnawt chhuak a, tangka thlengtute tangka chu a leih bua a, an dawhkânte a nam thlûksak bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tin, ṭhuro zuartute hnênah chuan, “Hêng thil hi heta ṭangin kalpui rawh u, ka Pa in sumdâwnna inah siam suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />(Tin, “I ina ka ṭhahnemngaihnain mi ei zo vang,” tih ziak a ni tih a zirtîrte chuan an hre leh ta a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda-ten a hnênah, “Hêng thil i tih hi chhinchhiahna eng nge min hmuhtîr theih?” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “He in hi tichhia ulang, ni thum chhûngin ka tungding leh ang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te chuan, “He in hi kum sawmli leh kum ruk sak a ni; nangin ni thum chhûngin i tung ding ang maw?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />(Nimahsela, a taksa in thu sawi a lo ni zâwk si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvângin, mitthi zîng ata a thawhlehin, chumi thu chu a sawi tawh tih a zirtîrten an hre leh ta a; tin, Pathian Lehkha Thu leh Isua thusawi chu an ring ta a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Kalhlên Kûta Jerusalem khuaa a awm lai chuan a thilmak tihte an hmu a, mi tam takin a hming an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isua chu an lakah a ngampa lo, mi zawng zawng a hriata,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />mihring thu tu ma hrilh fiah a ngaih loh avângin; amahin mihring chhûnga awm apiang chu a hre si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaite zînga mi, a hming Nikodema, Juda-te hotu pakhat a awm:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chu mi chu zânah Isua hnênah a lo kal a, a hnênah, “Rabbi, Pathian hnên ata zirtîrtua lo kal i ni tih kan hria; Pathian an chunga a awm loh chuan, hêng thilmak i tih ang hi tu mân an ti thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Tihtak meuhin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che, mi tu pawh an pianthar loh chuan Pathian ram an hmu thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nikodeman a hnênah, “Mi a tar hnuin engtin nge a pian theih ang? A nu pumah vawi hnih lûtin a piang thei em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Tihtak meuhin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che, mi tu pawh tuiah leh thlarauva an pian loh chuan Pathian ramah an lût thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tisaa piang apiang tisa a ni; Thlarauva piang apiang thlarau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I piangthar tûr ka tih che hi mak ti suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thli khawiah pawh a duh duhin a tleh ṭhîn, a ri i hria e; nimahsela, khawi aṭanga lo kal nge, khawiah nge a kal dâwn tih pawh i hre si lo; tu pawh Thlarauva piang chu chutiangin an awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Nikodeman a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Chûng thil chu engtin nge a awm theih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Israel-te zirtîrtu i ni si a, chûng chu i hre lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che, keinin kan hriat chu kan sawi ṭhîn, kan hmuh chu kan hriattîr ṭhîn; nimahsela, kan thu hriattîr in âwih si ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawvêla thil ka hrilh che u mah âwih lo che u a, vâna thil hrilh che u ila engtin nge in âwih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vânah tu mah an lâwn ngai lo, vân aṭanga lo chhuka chauh lo hi chu, Mihring Fapa, vâna awm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Mosian thlalêrah rûl a khai kân ang khân Mihring Fapa hi khai kânin a awm bawk tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tu pawh amah ring apiangin amah avânga chatuana nunna an neihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathianin khawvêl a hmangaih êm êm a; chutichuan, a Fapa mal neih chhun a pe a, amah chu tu pawh a ring apiang an boral lohva, chatuana nunna an neih zâwk nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khawvêl thiam loh chantîr tûrin Pathianin a Fa khawvêlah a tîr lo, khawvêl amah avânga an dam theihna tûrin a tîr a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu pawh amah ring chu thiam lohvin an awm lo vang; tu pawh ring lo chu tûn apangin thiam lohvin an awm, Pathian Fapa mal neih hming an rin loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hei hi thiam lohna a ni, êng khawvêlah a lo kal a; nimahsela, miten êng aiin thim an duh zâwk, an thiltihte a sual avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu pawh thil sual ti apiangin êng an haw ṭhîn, êngah pawh an lo kal lo; chuti lo chuan, an thiltihte a lang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, tu pawh thil dik ti apiang an thiltihte Pathian avânga ti an ni tih a lan nân, êngah an lo kal ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan Isua chu a zirtîrte nên Judai ramah an kal a, chutah chuan Isua an hnênah a awm reng a, a baptis ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Johana pawhin Ainon-ah, Salim khaw kiangah a baptis bawk a, chutah chuan tui a tam avângin; tin, mi an lo kal a, baptisma an chang hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Johana chu tân inah an la khung si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Johana zirtîrte leh Juda pakhat, sil fai thûah an lo inhnial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Johana hnênah an lo kal a, a hnênah, “Rabbi, Jordan râla i hnêna awm, a thu mi i hriattîr khân ngai teh, kha mi khân mi a baptis a, mi zawng zawng a hnênah an lo kal a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Johanan a chhâng a, “Mihringin eng mah an nei thei lo, vâna mi pêk a nih loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />‘Kei, Krista ka ni lo ve, a hmaa mi tirh ka ni,’ ka tih kha, nangni ngei mi hriatpuitu in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mo neitu chu a pasal chu a ni; nimahsela, moneitu ṭhian, a thu lo ngaichâng rengtu chu moneitu aw a hriat chuan a lâwm êm êm ṭhîn; hei, ka lâwmna a thleng ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ani chu tlatlum tûr a ni, kei erawh chu lâng tûr ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chung lam aṭanga lo kal chu mi zawng zawng aia chungnung ber a ni; leia piang chu leia mi a ni a, lei thu a sawi ṭhîn, vân aṭanga lo kal chu mi zawng zawng aia chungnung ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A hmuh leh a hriat apiang a hriattîr ṭhîn a ni; tu mân a thu hriattîr an âwih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A thu hriattîr âwih chuanin, ‘Pathian chu mi dik tak a ni,’ tiin, a hming nemin a ziak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian tirh chuan Pathian thu a sawi ṭhîn; ani chuan teh kherin Thlarau a pe si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pain Fapa a hmangaih a, a kutah engkim a pe tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tu pawh Fapa ring apiangin chatuana nunna an nei tawh; nimahsela, tu pawh Fapa thu âwih lo apiangin nunna an nei lo vang a, Pathian thinur an chungah a awm reng zâwk a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Isuan Johana aiin zirtîr tam zâwk a siam leh a baptis thu Pharisaiten an hria tih Lalpa chuan a hriat veleh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(nimahsela, Isua meuh chuan a baptis lo, a zirtîrten an baptis zâwk ṭhîn),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judai ram chu a kalsan a, Galili ramah a kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, Samari ram a kal tlang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samari ram khaw pakhat Sukar an tih chu a lo thleng a, Jakoban a fa Josefa hnêna hmun a pêk kiang kha;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jakoba tuichhunchhuah pawh kha chutah chuan a awm. Chutichuan, Isua chu a kal hah avângin tuichhunchhuah sîrah chuan a ṭhu chawt a: chawfâk hun lai a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Samari hmeichhe pakhat tui chawiin a lo kal a. Isuan a hnênah, “In tûr mi pe rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(A zirtîrte lah chu ei tûr leiin khuaah an kal tawh si a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samari hmeichhia chuan a hnênah, “Nang Juda mi i ni a, kei Samari hmeichhia ka ni si a, eng tizia nge ka hnêna in tûr mi dîl?” a ti a. (Juda-ten Samari mite chu engah mah an hmang ngai si lo.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Pathian thilpêk leh, ‘In tûr mi pe rawh,’ i hnêna titu hi hria la chu, nangin a hnênah i dîl zâwk tûr a ni a; tin, anin tui nung a pe tawh tûr che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan a hnênah, “Ka pu, khaina eng mah i nei si lo va, tuichhunchhuah a thûk vei nên, khawi ata nge tui nung chu i hmuh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan pu Jakoba aiin i ropui zâwk em ni? Ani chuan he tuichhunchhuah hi min pe a, amah pawhin a in a, a fapate, a rante nên,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Tu pawh he tui in apiang an tuihâl leh ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tu pawh an hnêna ka pêk tûr tui in apiang erawh chu kumkhuain an tuihâl lo vang, keiin an hnêna tui ka pêk tûr chu an kawchhûngah tui hna a lo awm ang a, chatuana nun thlengin a chik chho vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan a hnênah, “Ka pu, chu tui chu mi pe rawh, ka tuihâl loh nân leh, hêng thleng thlenga tui chawi tûra ka lo kal ṭhin loh nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “I pasal va ko la, hetah lo haw leh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan a hnênah, “Pasal ka nei hlei nêm,” a ti a, a chhâng a. Isuan a hnênah, “ ‘Pasal ka nei hlei nêm,’ i tih hi i tidik e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />pasal panga i nei tawh, tûna mi i neih hi i pasal a ni lo rêng a ni, he thu hi i tidik e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan a hnênah, “Ka pu, zâwlnei i ni tih ka hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keini thlahtute chuan he tlângah hian Pathian chibai an bûk ṭhîn; nimahsela, nangni zawngin, ‘Mihringin Pathian chibai an bûkna tûr hmun chu Jerusalem khuaah a awm,’ in ti ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Hmeichhia, ka thu âwih rawh, he tlângah kher lo pawh, Jerusalem khuaah kher lo pawh, Pa chibai in bûk hun a thleng dâwn ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangnin in hriat loh chibai in bûk ṭhîn; keini zawngin kan hriata chu chibai kan bûk ṭhîn. Chhanhimna Juda-te hnên ata a lo chhuak dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, a hun a thleng dâwn ta, tûnah pawh a thleng tawh mêk, chumi hunah chuan Pathian chibai bûktu tak takten thlarau leh tihtak zetin Pa chibai an bûk ang, Pain chutiang mi chu a chibai bûktu tûrin a zawng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian chu Thlarau a ni; a chibai bûktuten thlarau leh tihtak zetin chibai an bûk tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan a hnênah, “Messia, Krista an tih chu a lo kal dâwn tih ka hria, ani chu a lo kal hunah engkim min la hrilh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Keimah a betu che hi amah chu ka ni asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, chutih lai chuan a zirtîrte chu an lo kal a, hmeichhia a bia chu mak an ti hle a; nimahsela, tu mân, “Eng nge i zawn? Engati nge hmeichhia i biak?” pawh an ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan a tuibêl a kalsan a, khuaah a kal a, mite hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ka thiltih apiang mi hrilh zêltu mi pakhat a awm a, lo kal ula, en teh u; Krista a ni thei âwm em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, anni chu khua ata chu an lo chhuak a, a hnên lam an pan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chumi hlân chuan zirtîrte chuan a hnênah, “Rabbi, ei rawh,” an ti chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan an hnênah, “Chaw in hriat loh ei tûr ka nei e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte chu an inbia a, “A ei tûr miin an rawn kensak em ni chu le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah a sawi a, “Mi tîrtu duh zâwng tih leh a hna thawh zawh tûr hi ka chaw a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nangnin, ‘Buh sengna tûr thla li a la awm,’ in ti lâwm ni? Ngai rawh u, ka hrilh a che u, dâk ulang, lote en rawh u, tûn apangin seng tûrin a êng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A âttuin hlawh a hmu ṭhîn a, chatuana nun thlenga awm tûrin rah a seng ṭhîn, a tuhtu leh a âttu an lâwm dun theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />‘Pakhatin a tuh ṭhîn a, mi dangin a ât ṭhîn,’ tih thu hi chumiah chuan a dik hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />In thawh rim loh ât tûrin ka tirh che u kha; mi dangin an thawk a, nangnin an thawh sa chu in chhunzawm a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chuan, “Ka thiltih apiang mi hrilh zêl,” tia a hriattîr thu avâng khân, chumi khuaa awm Samari mi tam takin Isua an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutichuan, Samari mite chu Isua hnênah an lo kal a, an hnêna awmah an ngên chiam a; tichuan, chutah chuan ni hnih a châm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, mi dang tam takin ama thu avângin an ring ve ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />tin, anni chuan hmeichhe hnênah chuan, “Tûnah zet chuan i thusawi avânga ring kan ni ta lo; keimahni ngeiin a thu kan hria a, he mi hi khawvêl Chhandamtu a ni ngei tih kan hre ta,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ni hnih hnuah chuta ṭang chuan a chhuak a, Galili ramah a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Isua ngeiin, zâwlnei chu ama khaw lamah chuan chawimawiin a awm ngai lo tih a hriattîr si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chutichuan, Galili ram a lo thlenin Galili rama miten an lo lâwm a, Jerusalem khuaa kût laia a thiltih zawng zawng an hmuh avâng khân; anni pawh chu kûtnaah chuan an kal ve si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tin, Galili rama Kana khua, tui uaina a chantîrna kha a lo thleng leh a. Tin, upa tu emaw a awm a, a fapa Kapernaum khuaah a damlo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu Judai ram ata Galili ramah a lo kal tih a hriat veleh a hnênah a han kal a, a fapa zuk tidam tûrin a ngên chiam a, a thi lek lek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Chhinchhiahnate leh thilmakte in hmuh loh chuan in ring tawp lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, upa chuan a hnênah, “Ka pu, ka fa thih hmain lo chhuk ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Haw leh ta mai rawh, i fapa chu a dam tawh e,” a ti a. Tin, chu mi chuan Isuan a hnêna thu a sawi chu a ring a, a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tin, a kal chhuk lai mêkin a bâwihten an lo hmuak a, “I fapa chu a dam ta,” an lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah a dam tirh lai a zâwt a. Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Niminah, ni her chauhvin a khawsik a reh ta a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Chutichuan, a pa chuan, Isuan a hnênah, “I fapa chu a dam tawh e,” a tih lai tak a ni tih a hre ta a; tin, amah leh a chhûngten an zain an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Chu chu Isuan a chhinchhiahna tih a vawi hnihna a ni, Judai ram ata Galili rama a lo kalin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng thil hnuah chuan Juda-te kût pakhat a awm a; Isua chu Jerusalem khuaah a han kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem-ah chuan Berâm Kawngkhâr kiangah dîl a awm a, chu chu Hebrai ṭawngin Bethesda an ti a, hulhliap panga a nei nghe nghe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chûngah chuan damlo te, mitdel te, kebai te, zeng te tam tak an mu hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan kum sawmthum leh kum riat nâ mi tu emaw a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a mu chu a hmu a, chutiang chuan rei tak a awm tawh tih a hria a, a hnênah, “Tihdam i duh em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, damlo chuan, “Ka pu, tui a fâwnin dîla mi dahtu ka nei lo va, ka kal chhûngin mi dangin mi pên thlâk khalh ṭhîn,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Tho la, i âwngphah la la, kein kal tawh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, thâwklehkhatan chu mi chu a dam ta nghâl a, a âwngphah chu a la a, a kal ta a. Chumi ni chu Chawlhni a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda-ten a dam taa hnênah chuan, “Chawlhni a nih hi, i âwngphah i lâk a thiang lo ve,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Mi tidamtu ngeiin ka hnênah, ‘I âwngphah la la, kein kal tawh rawh,’ mi ti a ni,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “ ‘I âwngphah la la, kein kal tawh rawh,’ i hnêna titu chu tu nge ni?” an ti a, an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, a dama chuan tu nge a nih a hre lo va, chutah chuan mipui an awm avângin Isua a kal bo ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nakinah chuan Isuan ani chu Pathian biak inah a hmu a, a hnênah, “Ngai rawh, i dam tâk hi, thil tisual leh tawh suh; chuti lo chuan, thil ṭha lo lehzual i chungah a lo awm dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chu mi chu a va kal a, Juda-te hnênah chuan a tidamtu chu Isua a ni tih a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Chawlhnia chûng thilte chu a tih avângin Juda-ten Isua an tiduhdah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan anni chu a bia a, an hnênah, “Ka Pain tûn thleng pawhin hna a thawk reng a, kei pawhin ka thawk ve a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda-ten tihhlum an tum lehzual a, Chawlhni a bawhchhiat avâng chauh pawh a ni lo va, Pathian ama Paah a vuaha, Pathian tluka a insiam avâng pawhin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Tihtak meuhin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, Fapain mahniin eng mah a ti thei lo, Pa thiltih a hmuh chauh lo chu; thil a tih ang apiang chu Fapa pawhin a ti ve ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pain Fapa a hmangaih a, a thiltih apiang a hnênah a entîr ṭhîn; hêng aia thiltih ropui zâwk hi a hnênah a la entîr ang, mak in tih atân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pain mitthite a kai tho va, a tinung ṭhîn angin, Fapa pawhin a duh apiang a tinung ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pain tu ma thu a rêlsak ngai lo, thu zawng zawng Fapa a rêltîr ta zâwk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />mi zawng zawngin Pa an zah angin, Fapa pawh an zahna tûrin. Tu pawh Fapa zah lo chu, Pa a tîrtu pawh chu zah lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh ka thu hriaa mi tîrtu ring chuan chatuana nunna a nei tawh, thiam lohvin a awm lo va, thihna ata a chhuak a, nunnaah a lût ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, a hun a thleng dâwn ta, tûnah pawh a thleng tawh mêk, chutih hunah chuan mitthiten Pathian Fapa aw an hria ang a, a hria apiang an nung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pain mahnia nun a nei ang bawkin, Fapa pawh mahnia nun neiin a siam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tin, Mihring Fapa a nih avângin a hnênah rorêl tûr thu a pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hêng hi mak ti suh u, a hun a thleng dâwn ta, chutih hunah chuan thlâna awm zawng zawngin a aw an hria ang a, an chhuak vek ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />thil ṭha titute chu nunna changin an tho leh ang a, thil sual titute chu thiam loh changin an tho leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Keimahin eng mah ka ti thei lo: benga ka hriat ang zêlin ro ka rêl ṭhîn; ka rorêl chu dik tak a ni, keima thû thûin awm ka tum lo va, mi tîrtu thû thû zâwka awm ka tum ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mahni chanchin hriattîr ila, ka thu hriattîr a dik lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka chanchin hriattîrtu chu mi dang a ni; ani chuan ka chanchin a hriattîr chu a dik tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nangnin Johana hnênah mi in tîr a; tin, ani chuan thutak chanchin a lo hriattîr kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thuhriattîr ka pawm erawh chu mihring thu a ni lo; nimahsela, in damna tûrin hêng thu hi ka sawi a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chu Johana chu khâwnvâr alh tak leh êng tak chu a ni, a êngah chuan hlim rih in duh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nimahsela, hriattîrna ka neih hi Johana hriattîrna thu ai khân a ropui zâwk a ni: Pain thiltih zawh tûra mi pêk, ka thiltih ngei hian Pain mi tîr tih ka chanchin a hriattîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pa mi tîrtu pawh chuan ka chanchin a hriattîr tawh. Nangnin eng tikah mah a aw in hre ngai lo va, a hmêl pawh in hmu ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A thu pawh in rilruah in pai reng lo, a tirha hi in rin loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Pathian Lehkha in chhiar ngun ṭhîn, a chhûngah chatuana nunna awma in rin avângin; chûng Lehkha chu ka chanchin hriattîrtu chu a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nimahsela, nunna nei tûrin ka hnênah in lo kal duh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mihring chawimawina ka zawng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangni ka hria a che u, Pathian hmangaihna in rilruah in nei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ka Pa hmingin ka lo kal a nih hi, nangnin mi lâwm si lo; mi dang mahni hmingin lo kal sela, ani chu in lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nangni inchawimawi tawn lâwmte u, engtin nge in rin theih ang? Pathian tak chauhva chhuak chawimawina chu in zawng si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Keiin Pa hnêna ka hêk che u ring suh u; nangmahni hêktu chu pakhat a awm, in rin Mosia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mosia in rin chuan kei pawh mi ring tawh tûr in ni; ani chuan keima chanchin asin a ziak ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Nimahsela, a thuziak chu in rin si loh chuan, engtin nge ka thu in rin ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng thil hnuah chuan, Isua chu Galili dîl, Tiberia dîl an tih râl lehlamah chuan a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, damlote chunga chhinchhiahna a tihte chu an hmuh avângin, mipui tam takin amah an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu tlângah chuan a kal chho va, chutah chuan a zîrtîrte hnênah a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Kalhlên Kût (Juda-te kût chu) a hnai tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu a dâk a, mipui tam takin a hnên lam rawn panin a hmu a, Philipa hnênah, “Hêngho ei tûr chhang khawi ata nge kan lei ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng thu chu amah fiah nân a sawi a ni, a tih tûr chu amahin a hre reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Philipa chuan a hnênah, “Mi tinin tlêm têa an chan ṭheuh tûr pawh, duli zahnih man chhangin a daih lo vang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte zînga pakhat, Simon Petera unau Andria chuan a hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Barli chhangpêr panga leh sangha pahnih nei mipa naupang pakhat hetah a awm; nimahsela, mi hêng zozai zîngah hian chûng chu eng tham nge ni ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Mite chu ṭhuttîr rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, chumi hmunah chuan hlobet tam tak a awm. Chutichuan, patlingte chu an ṭhu a, an tam lam chu sângnga lai an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Isuan chhangpêrte chu a la a, lâwmthu a sawi zawhin a ṭhuhote hnênah chuan a sem a, chutiang bawkin sanghate pawh chu an duh tâwkin a sem bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, an kham hnuin, a zirtîrte hnênah chuan, “Eng mah bo lo tûrin a bângnawite chhar rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, an chhar a, barli chhangpêr panga eitute ei bângnawite chuan bâwmrâng sâwm leh pahnih an tikhat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, mite chuan chhinchhiahna a tih chu an hmuh veleh, “He mi hi zâwlnei, khawvêla lo kal tûr kha a lo nih ngei hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, amah chu lala siam tûra man luih tumin an lo kal dâwn tih Isuan a hria a, tlângah amah chauhvin a kal hrang leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, khua a lo tlai lam chuan a zirtîrte chu dîlah chuan an zuk kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />lawngah an chuang a, dîlah chuan Kapernaum khua an pan a. Tin, khua a thim ta a, Isua lah chu an hnên a la thleng si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thlipui nasa tak a tleh avângin tui a fâwn sâng telh telh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, fîng sawmhnih leh fîng nga emaw, fîng sawmthum emaw an kar chuan Isua chu dîl chungah chuan kea kala lawng rawn hnaihin an hmu a, an hlau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan an hnênah, “Keimah ka ni alâwm, hlau suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, lawngah chuan chuantîr an duh ta a; tin, chawplehchilhin lawng chuan an pan khawmual chu a thleng ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A tûkah chuan dîl râl lehlama mipui dingte chuan, lawng pakhat lo chu lawng dang a awm lo va, Isua chu a zirtîrte hnênah lawngah chuan a chuang ve lo va, a zirtîrte chu anmahni chauhvin an kal tih an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />(Nimahsela, Lalpan lâwmthu a sawi hnua chhang an eina hmun kiangah khân, Tiberia khua aṭangin lawng tête a lo thleng si a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipui chuan Isua leh a zirtîrte chu an awm ta lo tih an hriatin, anni pawh lawng têahte chuan an chuang a, Isua zawngin Kapernaum khua an lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, dîl râla an rawn hmuhin a hnênah, “Rabbi, eng tikah nge he lam i lo thlen?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, chhinchhiahnate in hmuh avanga mi zawng in ni lo va, chhangpêr in ei puar avâng khân a nih zâwk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chaw dangral mai ûmin phe phe suh u; chatuana nun thlenga awm reng tûr chaw, Mihring Fapain a pêk tûr che u chu, ûmin phe zâwk rawh u; Pa Pathian chuan ani chu a chhinchhiah tawh si a,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Pathian hna kan thawh theih nân thil eng nge kan tih tûr?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Pathian hnathawh chu hei hi a ni, a mi tirh hi ring ula,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Chhinchhiahna eng nge i tih ang, kan hmuha kan rin theihna tûr chein? Thil eng nge i tih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kan thlahtuten thlalêrah manna kha an ei ṭhîn, ‘Vân aṭang chuan an hnênah chhang ei tûr a pe,’ tih ziak angin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, vân aṭanga chhang in hmuh kha Mosia pêk che u a ni lo; ka Pa erawh chuan vân aṭangin chhang tak a pe che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian chhang chu vân aṭanga lo chhuka, khawvêl hnêna nun petu hi a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa, chu chhang chu kumkhuain min pe rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Kei hi nunna chhang chu ka ni; tu pawh ka hnêna lo kal chu a ril a ṭâm lo vang, tu pawh mi ring chu eng tikah mah a tuihâl lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangnin mi hmuh pawhin mi ring si lo tih ka hrilh che u kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pain mi pêk zawng zawng ka hnênah an lo kal vek ang; tu pawh ka hnêna lo kal chu ka hnawt chhuak tawp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mahni duh zâwng ti tûra vân aṭanga lo chhuk ka ni lo va, mi tîrtu duh zâwng ti tûra lo chhuk ka ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hei hi mi tîrtu duh zâwng chu a ni, anin mi pêk zawng zawng eng mah hloh lo ila, ni kin nîah chuan kai tho zâwk ila.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, hei hi ka Pa duh zâwng a ni, tu pawh Fa hmua, ring apiangin chatuana nunna nei sela; tin, keiin ni kin nîah chuan ani chu ka kai tho vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, “Vân aṭanga chhang lo chhuk chu ka ni,” a tih avângin Juda-te chu a chungah an phunnawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“He mi hi Josefa fa, Isua a ni lo vem ni, a nu leh pa pawh kan hriat hi? ‘Vân aṭanga lo chhuk ka ni,’ eng ti tiha ti nge ni le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Phun phunnawi suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Pa mi tîrtuin a hîp loh chuan tu mah ka hnênah an lo kal thei lo vang; tin, keiin ni kin nîah chuan a lo kala chu ka kai tho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Zâwlneite lehkhabuah, ‘Pathian zirtîrin an awm vek ang,’ tih ziak a ni. Mi tin Pa thu hriaa zir apiang chu ka hnênah an lo kal ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tu mahin Pa an hmu ngai ka ti lo, Pathian hnêna lo chhuaka chauh lo chuan; ani chuan Pa chu a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh a ring chuan chatuana nunna an nei tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Kei hi nunna chhang ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />In thlahtuten thlalêrah manna kha an ei na a, an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hei hi vân aṭanga chhang lo chhuk chu a ni, miin a eia a thih loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kei hi vân aṭanga chhang nung lo chhuk chu ka ni, tu pawhin he chhang hi a ei chuan chatuanin a nung reng ang; a ni, khawvêl nun nâna ka pêk tûr chhang chu ka tisa hi a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda-te chu an inhnial a, “He mi hian engtin nge a tisa ei tûrin min pêk theih ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, Mihring Fapa tisa in eia, a thisen in in bawk loh chuan, nangmahniin nunna nei hek lo che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tu pawh ka tisa eia ka thisen in chuan chatuana nunna a nei tawh; tin, ni kin nîah chuan ani chu ka kai tho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ka tisa hi chaw tak a ni a, ka thisen hi in tûr tak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Tu pawh ka tisa eia ka thisen in chu, keimahah a awm reng ṭhîn, kei pawh amahah ka awm reng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Pa nung chuan mi tîr a, Pa zâra nung ka ni ang bawkin, tu pawh mi ei chu keima zârah ani pawh a nung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Hei hi vân aṭanga chhang lo chhuk chu a ni; chi thlahtuten chhang an ei a, an thi ang kha a ni lo, tu pawh hemi chhang hi ei chu chatuanin a nung reng ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Chûng thu chu inkhâwmna inah a sawi a, Kapernaum khuaa a zirtîr lai khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Chutichuan, a zirtîrte a ṭhen tam takin chu chu an hriatin, “Hei hi thu khirh tak a ni, tu nge dawngsawng thei ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Chutichuan, chumi thûah chuan a zirtîrte an phunnawi tih Isuan a rilruin a hria a, an hnênah, “He thu hian a tilungni lo che u elo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Mihring Fapa hi hmâna a awmna ngaia lâwn chhova in hmuh chuan, engtin nge in tih ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tinungtu chu thlarau a ni, tisa chu eng mahah a tlâktlai lo; in hnêna thu ka sawite hi thlarau a ni, nunna pawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Nimahsela, in zîngah a ṭhen ring lo in awm e,” a ti a. (Isuan amah ring lotute leh a mantîrtu tûr chu a tîr ata a hre reng si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tin, amah vêk chuan, “Chuvâng chuan a ni, in hnênah, ‘Pain a puih loh chuan tu mah ka hnênah an lo kal thei lo vang,’ ka tih kha ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Chu veleh a zirtîrte zînga tam tak an kal bo va, amah an pâwl leh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Chutichuan, Isuan sâwm leh pahnihte hnênah chuan, “Nangni pawhin kal bo in duh ve em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Tin, Simon Peteran a hnênah, “Lalpa, tu hnênah nge kan kal ang? Nangin chatuana nunna thu i nei alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Nang Pathian Mi Thianghlima chu i ni tih kan âwih ta a, hriat pawh kan hria e,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Nangni sâwm leh pahnihte hi keima thlan in ni lâwm ni? In zînga mi pakhat Diabola a ni lehnghâl vei nên,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />(Iskariot Simona fapa Juda, sâwm leh pahnihte zînga tel vea thu kha a sawi a ni, ani chu a mantîrtu tûr a ni si a.)
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan Isuan Galili ram a fang a; Juda-ten amah tihhlum an tum avângin Judai ram chu a fang duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te bâwkte kût chu a hnai tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, a unauten a hnênah, “Heta ṭang hian Judai ramah va kal rawh, i zirtîrte pawhin i thiltih hi an hmuh theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu mân a rûkin thil eng mah an ti lo, mahni hmingthan duh siin. Hêng thilte hi i tih tak zet chuan khawvêl hnênah inentîr rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />(A unaute pawh chuan amah an ring si lo va.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Ka hun a la thleng lo; nangni hun erawh chu kumkhuain a thleng reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawvêlin nangni an haw thei lo a che u, kei erawh chu mi haw ṭhîn, an thiltihte a sual tih ka hrilhfiah ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangni kûtnaah han kal rawh u, kei zawng tûn kûtah hian ka han kal dâwn rih lo ve, ka hun a la thlen loh avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu chu an hnênah a sawi a, Galili ramah a la awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, a unaute chu kûtnaa an chhoh tâk hnu chuan, ani pawh vântlâng hriat lohvin, a rûk angin a han kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Juda-ten kûtnaah chuan ani chu an zawng a, “Khawiah nge a awm?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a chungah mipuite zînga mi chu an phun ru sup sup a, a ṭhenin, “Mi ṭha a ni e,” an ti a; ṭhenkhatin, “Hnai lo ve, mipui a bum zâwk ṭhîn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda-te an hlauh avângin tu mân a chungchâng thu an sawi lang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, kût vânglai takin Isua chu Pathian biak inah a han kal a, a zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Juda-ten, “He mi hian zir ngai lovin engtin nge lehkha a thiam?” an ti a, mak an ti hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Isuan anni chu a chhâng a, “Ka thu zirtîr hi ka ta a ni lo va, mi tîrtu ta a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tu pawh ama duh zâwng tih duh chuan, ka thu zirtîr hi Pathian tihchhuah nge keima phuah chawpa ka sawi a hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu pawh mahni phuah chawp thu sawi chu, mahni mawina zawng a ni; a tîrtu mawina zawng erawh chu, chu mi chu mi tak zet a ni, amahah chuan dik lohna rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mosian dân chu in hnênah a pe lo che u em ni? Nimahsela, in zîngah tu mahin dân chu in zâwm si lo. Nangnin engati nge min tihhlum in tum?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, mipui chuan, “Ramhuai zâwl i nih hi; tuin nge tihhlum tum che?” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a chhâng a, an hnênah, “Thil pakhat ka tih kha nangni zawng zawngin mak in tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian a ni, Mosian serhtan thu kha a pêk che ua (Mosia tihchhuah a ni si lo va, thlahtute tihchhuah a ni zâwk si a), Chawlhni pawha mi serh in tan ṭhin ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mosia dân bawhchhiat loh nân, Chawlhniah pawh mipain a serh a tantîr si chuan, keiin Chawlhnia mi ka tihdam tâk viah avângin ka chungah in thinur bîk maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A lan angin ngaihtuah suh ula, fel takin ngaihtuah zâwk rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khuaa mi ṭhenkhatin, “He mi hi tihhlum an tuma chu a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />En teh u, a langin thu a sawi a, a hnênah eng mah an sawi si lo. Amah hi Krista a ni tih hotuten an hre ta tak zet em maw ni aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />He mi hi a pianna chin lam kan hre si a, Krista erawh chu a lo thlen hunah chuan a pianna chin tu mân an hre lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, Isua chu Pathian biak ina a zirtîr pahin a au va, “Nangnin mi hria e, ka pianna chin pawh in hria e; nimahsela, mahni thûa lo kal ka ni lo, mi tîrtu hi mi tak zet a ni, ani chu in hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan ani chu ka hria; a hnên aṭanga lo chhuak ka ni a, ani chuan mi tîr a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutichuan, ani chu man an tum a; nimahsela, a hun a la thlen loh avângin tu mân an khawih si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mipui zînga tam tak erawh chuan ani chu an ring a, “Krista chu a lo thlen hunah, he mi tih aia tam zâwk thilmak a rawn ti ang em ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaiten a chunga mipui phun rûkna thute chu an hria a; tichuan, puithiam lalte leh Pharisaiten amah man tûrin tiangkengtute an tîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Rei lo tê in hnênah ka awm rih zet ang a, mi tîrtu hnênah ka kal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nangnin mi zawng ang a, mi hmu si lo vang; ka awmnaah pawh in lo kal thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te chu an inbia a, “Kan hmuh loh tûrin he mi hi khawiah nge a kal dâwn? Grik-te zînga Pêm darhho hnêna kalin Grik-te chu a zirtîr dâwn em ni ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />‘Nangnin mi zawng ang a, mi hmu si lo vang a; ka awmnaah pawh in lo kal thei lo vang,’ a tih hi eng a tihna nge ni ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, kût ṭiak dâwn ni, ni ropui berah chuan Isua a ding a, a au va, “Tu pawh a tuihâl chuan ka hnênah lo kal sela, in rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tu pawh mi ring chu, Pathian Lehkha sawi angin, tui nung luite a pumah a lo luang chhuak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />(Chûng thu chu amah ringtuten Thlarau an la neih tûr thu a sawina a ni; Thlarau chu pêk a la ni rih lo, Isua chu chawimawia a la awm loh avângin.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipui zînga ṭhenkhatin chûng thu chu an hriatin, “Hei hi zâwlnei chu a nih tak hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ṭhenkhatin, “Hei hi Krista chu a ni,” an ti a. Ṭhenkhat erawh chuan, “Khawnge Krista chu Galili rama a lo chhuah tehlul ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Krista chu Davida thlahte zîngah, Davida awmna khua Bethlehem aṭanga chhuak tûr a ni tih Pathian Lehkhain a sawi lo vem ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chutichuan, amah avângin mipui chu an inṭhen a, an inkhing ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat chuan man an duh a; nimahsela, tu mân an khawih si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, tiangkengtute chu puithiam lalte leh Pharisaite hnênah an lo kal leh a; tin, anni chuan an hnênah, “Engati nge in rawn hruai loh?” an lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tiang kengtute chuan, “Sawtiang rêngin miin thu an sawi ngai lo,” an ti a, an chhâng a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, Pharisaite chuan an hnênah, “Nangni pawh bumin in awm ve ta elo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hotute leh Pharisaite zînga mi rêng rêng amah ring an awm tawh em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hêng dân hre lo mipuite tehchai hi ânchhe dawng an ni asin,” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Nikodema, hmâna Isua hnêna lo kal kha, an zînga tel ve a ni a, an hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“Ama kâ ngeia a thu hriat leh a thiltih hriat hmain, kan dânin mi thiam loh a chantîr ngai em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “Nang pawh chu Galili mi i ni ve elo? Zawng la, Galili ramah chuan zâwlnei tu mah chhuak tûr an awm lo tih hre ta che,” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, mi tin mahni in ṭheuhvah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isua erawh chu Olive tlângah a kal ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, zîngah Pathian biak inah a lût leh a, mi zawng zawng a hnênah an lo kal a; tin, ani chu a ṭhu a, anmahni a zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, lehkhaziaktute leh Pharisaiten hmeichhe pakhat a uire lai an man an rawn hruai a; tin, a laiah an dintîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isua hnênah, “Zirtîrtu, he hmeichhia hi a uire lai an man a ni, a uire lai takin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dân lehkhabuah Mosian hetiang mi hi lunga den hlum thu min pe a; nangin engtin nge i ngaih?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu thu chu amah fiah nân an ti a, a hêkna tûr an hmuh theih nân. Chutichuan, Isua a kûn a, a kutzungin leiah a ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, an zawh sek sek avângin ani chu a tho va, an hnênah, “In zînga sual nei lo apiangin amah chu lungin dêng hmasa rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, a kûn leh a, a kutzungin leiah a ziak leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a thusawi chu an hriatin, upa berin a ṭan a, a tâwp thlengin, pakhat khatin an relh chhuak ta zêl a; chutichuan, Isua chauh a awm ta a, hmeichhia, a laia a awmna ngaia awm nên khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu a tho va, a hnênah, “Hmeichhia, khawiah nge an awm tâk? Tu mân thiam loh an chantîr na che nge?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Lalpa, tu mân mi chantîr lo ve,” a ti a. Tin, Isuan, “Kei pawhin thiam loh ka chantîr lo va che; kal la, tûn hnuah tisual leh tawh suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah thu a sawi leh a, “Kei khawvêl êntu ka ni; tu pawh mi zui chu thimah a lêng tawp lo vang a, nunna êng a nei zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pharisaiten a hnênah, “Mahni thu hriattîr i ni, i thu hriattîr a dik lo ve,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Mahni thu hriattîr mah ila, ka thu hriattîr hi a dik a ni; keiin ka lo chhuahna leh ka kalna tûr chin pawh ka hria e; nangni zawngin ka lo chhuahna leh ka kalna tûr chin pawh in hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangnin tisa angin in sawisêl ṭhîn; kei zawngin tu mah ka sawisêl lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ni, sawisêl mah ila ka sawisêlna a dik ang; keimah chang ka ni lo va, kei leh Pa mi tîrtu kan ni zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ni, in Dân Lehkhabuah pawh, ‘Mi pahnih thu a dik,’ tih ziak a ni bawk alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei hi mahni thu hriattîrtu ka ni, Pa mi tîrtu chuan ka thu a hriattîr bawk,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “I Pa khawiah nge?” an ti a. Isuan, “Nangnin kei mi hre lo, ka Pa pawh in hre lo; kei mi hriat chuan ka Pa pawh in hria ang,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng thu chu Pathian biak inah a zirtîr pahin, thawhlâwm dahna hmunah a sawi a; tu mân amah an man si lo, a hun a la thlen loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Ka kal bo dâwn hi, nangnin mi zawng ang a, in sual nei rengin in thi ang; ka kalna tûrah in lo kal thei lo vang,” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Juda-ten, “ ‘Ka kalna tûrah in lo kal thei lo vang,’ a tih hi, a intihlum dâwn em ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Nangni hnuai lama chhuak in ni; kei zawng chung lama chhuak ka ni; nangni he khawvêla chhuak hi in ni; kei zawng he khawvêla chhuak hi ka ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, in hnênah, ‘In sual nei rengin in thi ang,’ ka tih kha; ani chu ka ni tih in âwih loh chuan in sual nei rengin in thi mawlh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Tu nge maw i nih le?” an ti a. Isuan an hnênah, “A tîr ata in hnêna ka sawi ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nangni chungchâng thûah hian thil tam tak sawi tûr leh ngaihtuah tûr ka nei; eng pawh ni rawh se, mi tîrtu chu mi dik tak a ni; a hnên aṭanga thu ka hriat apiang khawvêl hnênah ka hrilh hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pa thu an hnênah a sawi tih an hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutichuan, Isua vêkin, “Nangnin Mihring Fapa hi in khai kân hnuah, ani chu ka ni tih leh, keiin mahni thuin thil eng mah ka ti lo va, Pain mi hrilh ang zêlin hêng thu hi ka sawi zâwk a ni tih in lo la hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi tîrtu chu ka hnênah a awm a, mi thlahthlam lo ve; a thil lâwm zâwng apiang ka tih fo avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu chu a sawi laiin mi tam takin amah chu an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, Isuan amah ringtu Juda-te hnênah chuan, “Ka thûa in awm reng chuan ka zirtîrte in ni tak tak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, thutak in hria ang a, thutak chuan bâwih a bân ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Abrahama thlahte kan ni asin, tûn thlengin tu ma bâwihah kan awm ngai lo, ‘Bâwih a bân ang che u,’ eng ti tiha i ti nge ni?” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh thil tisual apiang, sual bâwih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Bâwih chu kumkhuain inah a awm reng lo; fapa erawh chu kumkhuain a awm reng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutichuan, Fapain bâwih a bân che u chuan in chhuak tak meuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Abrahama thlahte in ni tih ka hria e; ni mah ula, mi thah in tum si, ka thuin in rilrua awmna a neih loh avangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Keiin ka Pa hnêna thil ka hmuh chu ka sawi ṭhîn; nangni pawhin in pa hnêna thil in hriat chu in ti ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Kan pa Abrahama a ni,” an ti a, an chhâng a. Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Abrahama fate in nih chuan Abrahama thil in ti ang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nimahsela, tûnah mi thah in tum si. Pathian hnêna thutak ka hriat hrilhtu che u ka ni asin; Abrahama zawngin hetiangin a ti lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nangni zawngin in pa thil chu in ti ṭhîn,” a ti a. Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Inuirea hrin kan ni lo ve, Pa pakhat chauh kan nei, Pathian chu,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Pathian in Pa a nih chuan nangnin mi hmangaih ang chu; Pathian hnên aṭanga lo chhuak leh a hnên ata lo kal ka ni si a; keima thûa lo kal ka ni hek lo, aman mi tîr zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Engati nge ka ṭawng awmzia in hriat loh? Ka thu in dawnsawn theih loh vâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nangni zawng in pa Diabola aṭanga chhuak in ni a, in pa duh zâwng tih in duh a ni. Ani chu a tîr ata tual that a ni, thutakah a awm lo, a chhûngah thutak rêng a awm loh avângin. Dâwt thu a sawiin ama tihchhuah a sawi a ni ṭhîn; dawthei a ni si, dâwt pa pawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Thutak ka sawi avângin nangnin mi ring lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />In zîngah tuin nge sual kawngah thiam loh mi chantîr thei awm? Thutak ka sawi pawhin nangnin engati nge mi rin loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pathian hnên aṭanga chhuak chuan Pathian thu a pawm ṭhîn; hemi avâng hian in pawm lo a ni, Pathian hnên aṭanga chhuak in nih loh avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te chuan a hnênah, “Samari mi, ramhuaizâwl i ni kan tih kha kan tidik zet lo vem ni?” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Isuan, “Ramhuaizâwl ka ni lo ve; ka Pa ka chawimawi a ni zâwk e, nangnin ka hming in tihchhiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Nimahsela, mahni mawina zawng ka ni lo; a zawngtu leh a ngaihtuahtu mi pakhat a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, miin ka thu a zawm chuan kumkhuain thih ni hmêl a hmu lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tin, Juda-ten a hnênah, “Ramhuaizâwl i ni tih tûnah kan hre ta. Abrahama a thi tawh, zâwlneite nên, nangin, ‘Miin ka thu a zawm chuan kumkhuain thihna a tem lo vang,’ i ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Kan thlahtu Abrahama aiin i ropui zâwk em ni? Ani pawh a thi tawh, zâwlneite pawh an thi tawh; tu-ah nge i insiam ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Mahni inchawimawi ila ka mawi engah mah a ni lo: ‘Kan Pathian,’ in tih ka Pa chu mi chawimawitu a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />nangnin amah in hre si lo; kei erawh chuan amah ka hria; ‘Amah ka hre lo,’ ti ila, nangmahni anga dawthei bawk ka ni ang; chutichuan, amah ka hria a, a thu pawh ka zâwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />In thlahtu Abrahama kha, ka ni hmu tûr a nih avângin a hlim êm êm ṭhîn; tin, a hmu ngei a, a lâwm hle a,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te chuan a hnênah, “Nang kum sawmnga pawh la ni lo pui che, Abrahama i hmu em ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, Abrahama awm hma pawhin ka awm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Chutichuan, a den nân lung an chhar a; nimahsela, Isua chu a biru a, Pathian biak in ata chu a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a kal pahin a pian tirh ata mitdel pakhat a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrten a hnênah, “Rabbi, mitdel saa a piang hi tuin nge thil tisual, he mi hian nge a nu leh a pain?” an ti a, an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isuan, “He mi hian a tisual lo, a nu leh a pain an tisual hek lo; Pathian hnathawh a chunga a lanna tûr a nih zâwk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chhûn a nih laiin mi tîrtu hna kan thawk tûr a ni; zân a nih dâwn tâk hi, chumi hunah chuan tu mân hna an thawk thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khawvêla ka awm chhûngin khawvêl êntu ka ni,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutianga a sawi zawh chuan leiah chil a chhâk a, chil chuan hlum a siam a, hlum chu a mitah a hnawih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tin, a hnênah, “Siloam dîlah va sil rawh,” a ti a (Siloam chu “Tirh” tihna a ni). Tichuan, a va kal a, a sil a, mitvârin a lo haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, a vêngte leh hmâna a kut dawh hmu ṭhînten, “He mi hi ṭhu chunga kut dawh ṭhîna kha a ni lo vem ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi dangin, “Ani kha a nih hi,” an ti a. Mi dangin, “A ni lo ve, a anpui a nih zâwk hi,” an ti a. Ani chuan, “Kha kha ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “I mit engtin nge a lo vâr le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Isua an tih khân hlum a siam a, ka mitah a hnawih a, ‘Siloam dîlah va kal la, sil rawh,’ mi ti a; chutichuan, ka va kal a, ka sil a, mitvârna ka hmu ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Ani chu khawiah nge a awm?” an ti a, “Ka hre lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, chumi hmaa mitdela chu Pharisaite hnênah an hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Isuan hlum a siama, a mit a tihvâr ni kha Chawlhni a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pharisaiten a mit a lo vâr tâk dânzia an zâwt leh a. Ani chuan an hnênah, “Ka mitah hlum a dah a, ka sil a, ka hmu thei ta mai a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Pharisai ṭhenkhatin, “Chu mi chu, Chawlhni a puithu loh avângin Pathian hnên aṭanga chhuak a ni lo vang,” an ti a. ṭhenkhat erawh chuan, “Mi sualin engtin nge hetiang thilmak a tih theih ang?” an ti a. Chutichuan, an inṭhen a, an inkhing ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, mitdel hnênah chuan, “I mit a tihvâr kha, nang eng angin nge amah chu i ngaih?” an ti leh a. Tin, ani chuan, “Zâwlnei a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda-ten a mit lo vâr taa nu leh pa chu an koh hma loh chuan, mitdel a ni ṭhîn a, a mit a lo vâr ta tih, a chungchâng thu chu an âwih lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a nu leh a pa hnênah, “He mi hi in fapa, mitdel saa piang a ni in tih kha a ni em? Engtin nge tûnah a hmuh theih tâk le?” tiin an zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a nu leh a pa chuan, “Hei hi kan fapa a ni tih kan hria, mitdel sain a piang tih pawh kan hria;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />nimahsela, engtin nge tûnah hian a lo hmuh theih tâk hi kan hre lo, a mit tivârtu pawh kan hre hek lo; amah zâwt rawh u; patling a ni alâwm; ama thu chu aman sawi ang hmiang,” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Juda-te an hlauh avângin a nu leh a pa chuan chûng thu chu an sawi a ni; Juda-ten, chûng hma pawh chuan tu pawhin, “Ani chu Krista a ni,” tia a ṭan chuan inkhâwmna in a hnawng ang tih an remti tlâng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan a ni, a nu leh a pa chuan, “Patling a ni alâwm, amah zâwt rawh u,” an tih ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, mitdel chu an ko nawn leh a, a hnênah, “Pathian fak rawh, kha mi kha zawng mi sual a ni tih kan hria e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Mi sual a ni nge ni lo ka hre lo; kawng khat ka hria, tûn hma khân ka mit a del a, tûnah ka hmuh theih tâk hi,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “I chungah engtin nge a tih? I mit engtin nge a tihvâr?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Nichinah khân ka hrilh che u kha, in hre duh si lo; engati nge in hriat leh duh tâk ni? Nangni pawh a zirtîrte nih ve in duh elo?” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan an hau va, “Nang hi ama zirtîr i ni a, keini zawng Mosia zirtîrte kan ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathianin Mosia a bia tih kan hria, he mi tehchai hi khawi aṭanga lo chhuak nge a nih kan hre hrep lo ve,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, chu mi chuan an hnênah, “Chu tak chu a ni a makna chu, khawi aṭanga lo chhuak nge a nih in hriat lohva, ka mit a tihvâr miau si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathianin mi sual thu a ngaithla ṭhîn lo tih kan hria; nimahsela, tu pawhin Pathian a ngaihsaka, a duh zâwng a tih chuan Pathianin ani chu a ngaithla ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khawvêl awm tirh ata tu mân mitdel saa piang mit an tivâr leh tih an hre ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />He mi hi Pathian hnên aṭanga chhuak a nih loh chuan eng mah a ti thei lo vang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Nang sual lailet dêra piang i ni alâwm, nangin min hrilh vei em ni?” an ti a, an chhâng a. Tichuan, ani chu an hnawt chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, an hnawt chhuak tih Isuan a lo hria a; tin, a zawng chhuak a, “Pathian Fapa i ring em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Ka pu, ani chu tu nge ni, ka rin theih nân?” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Ani chu i hmu tawh reng alâwm, a be mêktu che hi a ni asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Lalpa, ka ring e,” a ti a, chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Rorêl tûrin he khawvêlah hian lo kal ka ni, mitdelte chu an mit a lo vârna tûr leh, mitvârte chu an mit a lo delna tûrin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, a hnêna Pharisai awmte chuan chûng thu chu an hria a, a hnênah, “Keini pawh hi mitdel kan ni ve elo?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Mitdel in nih chuan sual in nei lo vang; nimahsela, ‘Kan hmu thei e,’ tûnah in ti si a; chuvângin, in sual a awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh berâm huanga kawngkhâra lût lova, dang lama lâwn lût chu, chu mi chu englo rûk hmang leh suamhmang a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu pawh kawngkhâra lût erawh chu berâm vêngtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kawngkhâr vêngtuin ani chu a lo hawnsak ṭhîn a; berâmten a aw an hre ṭhîn a; ama berâmte chu an hmingah a ko ṭheuh va, a hruai chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ta zawng zawng a chhuahtîr veleh an hma a hruai a, berâmte chuan amah an zui ṭhîn a, a aw an hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi dang zawng an zui lo vang a, an tlân bosan zâwk ang; mi dangte aw zawng an hriat loh avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu tehkhin thu chu Isuan an hnênah a sawi a; nimahsela, eng thu nge an hnênah a sawi tih an hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Isuan an hnênah a sawi leh a, “Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, kei hi berâm kawngkhâr chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hmaa lo kal zawng zawngte kha rûk hmangte, suamhmangte an ni vek a; nimahsela, berâmte chuan an thu an âwih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei kawngkhâr chu ka ni; tu pawh keimahah a luh chuan humhimin a awm ang a, a lûtin a chhuak ang a, ei tûr a hmu bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rûk hmang chu ru tûr leh tihlum tûr leh tichhe tûr lo chuan a lo kal lo; kei zawng nun an neih nân, tam taka an neih nân lo kal ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei berâm vêngtu ṭha ka ni; berâm vêngtu ṭhain berâmte tân a nun a pe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Inhlawhfa, berâm vêngtu tak ni lova, berâmte a ta ni lova chuan, chinghne lo kal a hmuhin berâmte a tlânsan ṭhîn; tin, chinghnia chuan berâmte a seh a, a tidarh ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />inhlawhfa a ni a, berâmte a ngaihsak loh avângin a tlân bo ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei zawng berâm vêngtu ṭha ka ni; Pain mi hriat leh keiin Pa ka hriat ang hian ka ta ka hria a, ka ta pawhin mi hria a ni; tin, beramte tân chuan ka nun ka pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, he berâm huanga mi lo hi berâm dang ka nei; anni pawh ka la rawn hruai tûr a ni, ka aw pawh an hria ang; chutichuan, pâwl khatin an awm ang a, a vêngtu pakhat nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian Pain mi hmangaih a ni, lâk leh tûra ka nun ka pêk dâwn avâng hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu mân mi lâksak lo vang, keima thû thûin ka pe zâwk dâwn a ni. Pe thei ka ni, la leh thei pawh ka ni. He thupêk hi ka Pa hnên aṭanga ka hmuh a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chûng thu avâng chuan Juda-te chu an inṭhen a, an inkhing leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ṭhen tam takin, “Ramhuai a zâwl a, a â a nih hi; engati nge a thu in ngaihthlâk?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ṭhenin, “Hêng thu hi ramhuaizâwl thusawi a ni lo ve. Ramhuaiin mitdel mit a tivâr thei em ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem khuaa inpumpêk kût lai a ni a, chu chu thlasik lai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu Pathian biak inah, Solomona hulhliapah a vei a vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te chu a vêlah an lo kal a, a hnênah, “Eng chen nge tuilairapin min siam dâwn? Krista i nih chuan fiah takin min hrilh rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “Ka hrilh tawh che u kha, in âwih si lo; ka Pa hminga thil ka tih hi, hêng hian ka chanchin a hriattîr a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nimahsela, in âwih si lo, ka berâm zînga mi in nih loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka berâmten ka aw an hre ṭhîn, kei pawhin anni chu ka hria, anni chuan min zui ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />an hnênah chatuana nunna ka pe a; kumkhuain an boral lo vang a, tu mân ka kut ata mi chhuhsak hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anni mi petu ka Pa chu, mi zawng zawng aia ropui ber a ni a; tu mân Pa kut ata chu an chhuhsak thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kei leh Pa chu pumkhat kan ni,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te chuan a denna tûrin lung an chhar leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Isuan anni chu a bia a, “Pa hnêna chhuak hnathawh ṭha tam tak ka entîr che u a, khâng hnathawhte zîngah khân, hna eng vâng khân nge lunga mi den dâwn hi?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Juda-te chuan a hnênah, “Hna ṭha chungah lungin kan den dâwn loh che hi; Pathian i sawi chhiat chungah leh, nang, mihring ni sia, Pathiana i insiam vâng zâwk hian a ni,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Isuan an hnênah, “In dân lehkhabuah, ‘Pathiante in ni ka ti,’ tih ziak a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pathian thu thlennate mah pathianho an tih chuan (Pathian Lehkha Thu bân theih a ni si lo va),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pain a ruata, khawvêla a tirha chungah hian, ‘Pathian Fapa ka ni,’ ka tih avângin, ‘Pathian i sawi chhia,’ in ti a ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka Pa hna thawk ka nih loh chuan mi ring suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, thawk ka nih chuan kei mi ring lo mah ula, hnathawhte tal hi ring rawh u; Pa keimahah a awm tih leh, kei Paah ka awm tih in hriata in rin nân,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chutichuan, ani chu man an tum leh a; nimahsela, an kut ata chu a chhuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jordan lui râlah, Johanan a tîra mi a baptis-na lamah khân a kal bo leh a, chutah chuan a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, mi tam tak a hnênah an lo kal a, “Johanan chhinchhiahna eng mah zawng a ti lo va; nimahsela, Johanan he mi chungchâng thu a sawi apiang kha a lo dik hle hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan mi tam takin amah an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat, Mari leh a laizâwn Marthi awmna khua Bethani-a mi Lazara, damlo a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(Mari, hriak rimtui Lalpa hnawiha, a sama a ke hrutu kha, kha mi nuṭa Lazara kha a ni, damlo chu.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a farnuten Isua hnênah, “Lalpa, ngai teh, i hmangaih kha a damlo ve,” tiin mi an tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Isuan chu chu a hria a, “He nâ hi thihna tûr a ni lo, Pathian mawi nân a ni zâwk e, Pathian Fapa chu hemi avâng hian a la mawina tûrin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Isuan Marthi te, a laizâwn te, Lazara te chu a hmangaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, a damlo tih a hriatin a awmna ngaiah ni hnih a la awm ta cheu va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan a zirtîrte hnênah, “Judai ramah i kal leh ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte chuan a hnênah, “Rabbi, hmân lawkah khân Juda-ten lunga den an tum che kha; chuti pawhin chutah chuan i kal leh bawk dâwn em ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Chhûnah dârkâr sâwm leh pahnih a awm lo vem ni? Mi chhûna a lên chuan a pai ngai lo, he khawvêl êng hi a hmuh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mi zâna a lên chuan a pai ṭhîn, amahah chuan êng a awm loh avângin,” a ti a, chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chûng thu chu a sawi a; tin, chumi hnuah chuan an hnênah, “Kan ṭhian Lazara chu a muhîl ta a; a muhîl kai harh tûrin ka kal dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, zirtîrte chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa, a muthilh tawh chuan a dam leh ang chu,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />(Isua chuan a thih thu a sawi a ni a; nimahsela, anni chuan a chawlh chhûnga a muthilh thu a sawi em maw an ti a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, Isuan fiah takin an hnênah a sawi a, “Lazara a thi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuta ka awm lo chu ka lâwm a ni, nangmahni avângin, in rin theih nân; nimahsela, a hnênah i kal ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Thoma, Phîra an tih chuan a zirtîrpuite hnênah, “A thihnaa thi ve tûrin i kal ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Isuan a thlenin thlânah ni li a lo awm tawh tih a hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bethani khua chu Jerusalem khaw kiang a ni a, fîng sâwm leh fîng nga laia hla a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tichuan, an nuṭa thih chunga tithlamuang tûrin Juda-ho tam tak Marthi leh Mari hnênah an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Marthi chuan Isua a lo kal dâwn tih a hriat veleh a va hmuak a; Mari erawh chu inah a la ṭhu reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Marthi chuan Isua hnênah, “Lalpa, heta awm ni la chu ka nuṭa a thi lo tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tûnah pawh Pathian hnêna i ngen apiang Pathianin a pe ang che tih ka hria e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “I nuṭa a tho leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Marthi chuan a hnênah, “Ni kin nia thawhlehnaah chuan a tho leh ang tih ka hria e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Kei hi thawhlehna leh nunna chu ka ni; tu pawh mi ring chu thi mah sela a nung reng ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />nung apiangin mi ring chu kumkhuain an thi lo vang. Chu thu chu i ring em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chuan a hnênah, “Ring e, Lalpa; Krista, Pathian Fapa, khawvêla lo kal tûra chu i ni tih ka ring e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, chu thu chu a sawi zawh veleh a kal a, a laizâwn Mari chu a rûkin a va ko va, “Zirtîrtu hetah a awm a, a ko va che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan chu chu a hriat veleh a tho thuai a, a hnênah a va kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />(Isua chu khuaah a la lût lo va, Marthiin a va hmuah laia a awmna ngaiah a la awm a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, in chhûnga a thlamuantu, a awmpui Juda-te chuan Mari a tho thuaia, a chhuak an hmuh veleh, thlânah ṭap tûrin a kal dâwn emaw an ti a, an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, Mari chuan Isua awmna chu a va thleng a, a hmuh veleh a ke bulah a bawkkhup a, a hnênah, “Lalpa, heta awm ni la chu, ka nuṭa a thi lo tûr,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tin, Isuan Mari ṭap leh a rawn zuitu Juda-te ṭap chu a hmu a, a rilruin a rûm a, a lungngai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Ani chu khawiah nge in zalh?” a ti a. Anni chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa, lo kal la, en teh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Isua chu a ṭap ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te chuan, “En teh u, Lazara hi a va lo hmangaih êm ve le!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nimahsela, ṭhenkhat chuan, “He mi, mitdel mit tivârtu hian he mi pawh hi a thih lohtîr thei lo vem ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu a rilruin a rûm leh a, thlân chu a thleng ta a. Chu thlân chu pûk a ni a, a kawngkaah chuan lung pakhat a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Isuan, “Lung hi chawi sawn rawh u,” a ti a. A thia farnu Marthi chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa, tûnah zawng a uih tawh ang; a thihna ni li a ni tawh si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “ ‘I rin chuan Pathian ropuizia i hmu ang,’ ka ti lo che em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chutichuan, lung chu an chawi sawn a. Tin, Isua chu a vanvadâk a, “Ka Pa, ka thu i ngaihthlâk avângin i chungah ka lâwm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Kumkhuain ka thu i ngaithla ṭhîn tih ka hre reng a ni; nimahsela, mipui din vêl avângin chu chu ka ti a ni, nangin mi tîr tih an rin theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, chutia a ṭawng zawh veleh chuan aw ring takin, “Lazar, lo chhuak rawh,” a ti a, a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, mitthi chu a kut a ke thlân puana tuam chungin a lo chhuak ta a, a hmai pawh inhrûkna puana tuam a ni a. Isuan an hnênah, “Phelh ula, kaltîr rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan Mari lênpuitu, Isua thiltih hmutu Juda-te zînga tam takin Isua an ring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nimahsela, a ṭhen Pharisaite hnênah an va kal a, an hnênah Isua thiltihte chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Chutichuan, puithiam lalte leh Pharisaite chuan rorêltuho an ko khâwm a, “Engtin nge kan tih ang? He mi hian thilmak tam tak a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hetianga kan thlahthlam chuan mi zawng zawngin amah an ring ang a; tin, Rom-a mite an lo kal ang a, kan hmun leh kan chite hi min lâksak ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, an zînga mi pakhat Kaiapha, chumi kuma puithiam lalber chuan an hnênah, “Nangnin eng mah in hre hauh lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />kan chi zawng zawng boral lohna tûrin, mi zawng zawng aia mi pakhat thih in tân a ṭha tih in ngaihtuah bawk lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />(Chu thu chu ama phuah chawpin a sawi lo, chumi kum chuan puithiam lalber a ni a, an chite aia Isua a thih tûr a sawi lâwk a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chumi chite ai chauh chuan a ni lo, Pathian fa khawvêla darhte zawng zawng pâwl khata a hruai khâwmna tûr pawhin a ni bawk.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Chutichuan, chumi ni achin chu amah tihlum tûrin an inrâwn ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Chuvângin, Isua chu Juda-te zîngah a langin a lêng leh ta lo va, chuta ṭang chuan thlalêr dep lama khaw pakhat, Ephraim an tihah chuan a va kal ta zâwk a; chutah chuan zirtîrte nên chuan an awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te Kalhlên Kût chu a hnai tawh a, mi tam tak chu inthian tûrin, ram ata Kalhlên Kût hmain Jerusalem khuaah an han kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Chutichuan, Isua an zawng a, Pathian biak inah ding chungin an inbia a, “Eng nge in rin? Kûtnaah a lo kal lo vang maw?” an inti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Puithiam lalte leh Pharisaiten amah chu an man theih nân, tu pawhin a awmna an hriat chuan puan tûr a ni tih thu an pe tawh si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Kalhlên Kûtna tûr ni ruk a la awmin, Isuan mitthi zîng ata a kaihthawh Lazara awmna Bethani khua kha a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan ama tân zân ruai an ṭheh a; Marthiin rawng a bâwl a, Lazara erawh chu a chawhlui kîlpuitu pakhat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Marin bûk zâtve spiknard hriak rimtui to tak a rawn keng a, Isua kete chu a chulh a, a samin a kete chu a hru a; tichuan, chu hriak rim chuan in chu a khat ta rum rum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Iskariot Juda, a zirtîr pakhat, a mantîrtu tûr chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“He hriak rimtui hi engati nge duli zathuma hralhin, mi retheite hnêna an pêk zâwk loh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />(Mi retheite a ngaihsak vânga chu thu chu sawi a ni lo; rûkru a ni a, tangka ip a kawl a, a chhûnga dah chu a lâk ṭhin vâng zâwk a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Mi phûm ni atân khêk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi retheite chu kumkhuain in hnêna awm an ni alâwm; kei erawh chu kumkhuaa in hnêna awm tûr ka ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutah chuan Isua a awm tih Juda hnamchawmten an lo hre ta a; tin, an lo kal a, Isua chauh rawn kal chhan an ni lo va, mitthi zîng ata a kaihthawh Lazara pawh kha hmuh duh fâwm an ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalte chu Lazara pawh tihlum tûrin an inrâwn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />amah avânga Juda-te tam takin an pakaisana, Isua an rin ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tûkah chuan kûtnaa lo kal mipui tam takin, Isua chu Jerusalem khuaah a lo kal dâwn tih an hriatin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tûmkaute an keng a, a hmuak tûrin an va chhuak a, “Hosanna, Lalpa hminga Israel Lal lo kal chu fakin awm rawh se,” tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Isuan sabengtungno a hmu a, a chungah a chuang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hlau suh, Zion fanu; En teh, i Lal chu, Sabengtungno chunga chuangin, A lo kal dâwn e,” tih ziak ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng chu a tîrin a zirtîrten an hre lo va; nimahsela, Isua chawimawia a awm hnuah chuan, a chanchinah chûng thu chu ziak a ni tih leh, a chungah chûng thil chu an lo ti ngei tih an lo hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lazara thlân ata a koh chhuaha, mitthi zîng ata a kaihthawh laia a hnêna mipui awmte khân a thu chu an hriattîr ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan a ni, mipuite pawh chuan amah chu an va hmuah ni, chu thilmak chu a ti tih an hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pharisaite chuan, “Hre rawh u, eng mah in tih theih loh hi; en rawh u, khawvêlin amah an zui tâk hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, kûtnaa Pathian chibai bûk tûra han kalte zîngah Grik tute emaw an awm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tin, chûngte chu Galili rama Bethsaida khuaa mi Philipa hnênah chuan an lo kal a, a hnênah, “Ka pu, Isua hmuh kan duh e,” an ti a, an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Philipa chuan Andria a rawn hrilh a, Andria leh Philipa chuan Isua an rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a chhâng a, an hnênah, “Mihring Fapa chawimawia a awm hun chu a thleng tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, buh fang leia a tlâk lohva, a thih loh chuan a mal chauhvin a awm reng ṭhîn; a thih erawh chuan tam takin a rah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu pawh a nun thlahlel chuan a hloh ṭhîn; tu pawh he khawvêlah hian a nun ngaitlâwm chuan chatuana nunna tûr a vawng reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu pawhin ka rawng a bâwl chuan mi zui rawh se; ka awmnaah ka rawngbâwltu pawh a awm ang; tu pawhin ka rawng a bâwl chuan ani chu Pain a chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Tûnah ka rilru a mangang e; eng nge ka sawi ang aw? ‘Ka Pa, hemi hun lakah hian mi chhandam rawh,’ ka ti ang em ni? Eng pawh ni sela, hemi tûr hi, hemi hun thleng hian ka awm chhan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka Pa, i hming chawimawi rawh,” a ti a. Chutichuan, vân aṭangin aw a lo chhuak a, “Ka chawimawi tawh, ka chawimawi leh bawk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, mipui a kianga dingte chuan chu chu an hria a, “Khawpui a ri a ni,” an ti a; mi dangten, “Vântirhkohvin amah a bia a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, “Chu aw chu ka tâna lo chhuak a ni lo, nangmahni tân a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tûnah he khawvêl hi ngaihtuah lai a ni; tûnah he khawvêl lal hi paih chhuah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, kei lei ata khai kânin ka awm chuan, mi zawng zawng keima hnênah ka hîp ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chu thu chu a thihzia tûr hriattîr nân a sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, mipui chuan a hnênah, “Krista chu chatuanin a awm reng dâwn tih dân lehkhabuah kan hria e; nangin, ‘Mihring Fapa khai kânin a awm tûr a ni,’ eng ti tiha ti nge i nih? Chu Mihring Fapa chu tu nge ni?” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Êng hi rei lo tê in zîngah a la awm rih e. Êng in neih chhûng hian lêng rawh u, thimin a nan loh nân che u; tu pawh thima lêng chuan a kalna chin a hre ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Êng in neih chhûng hian êng hi ring rawh u, êng fate in lo nih theih nân,” a ti a. Chûng thu chu Isuan a sawi a; tin, a kal a, an hmuh loh tûrin a biru ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An hmaah chutiang thilmak tam tak chu ti mah sela, amah an ring si lo:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Lalpa, kan thusawi tuin nge ring? Lal kut pawh tu hnênah nge a lan?” tih, zâwlnei Isaia thusawi kha a thlen nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian a ni an rin theih loh, Isaian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Aman an mit a tidel a, An thinlung a tiâ a; Chuti lo chuan, an mitin an hmu ang a, An thinlungin an hre dah ang a; Tin, an hawi kîr leh dah ang a, Keiin anni chu ka tidam dah ang e,” tih a sawi leh avâng hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Isaian a ropuizia a hmuh leh a chanchin thu a sawi avângin chûng thu chu a sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Nimahsela, hotute zînga tam takin Isua an ring ta a; amaherawhchu, Pharisaite avângin an inpuang lo; chuti lo chuan, inkhâwmna in hnawngin an awm ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Pathian hnêna ropuina ai chuan mihring hnêna ropuina an duh zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu a au va, “Tu pawh mi ring chu kei mi ring a ni lo, mi tîrtu ring a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tu pawh mi hmu chu mi tîrtu hmu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Êntua khawvêla lo kal ka nih hi, tu pawh mi ring apiang thima an awm reng loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tu pawh ka thusawi hriain, âwih lo mah sela, keiin thiam loh ka chantîr lo; khawvêl thiam loh chantîr tûra lo kal ka ni lo va, khawvêl chhanhim tûra lo kal ka ni zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tu pawh mi duh lova, ka thusawite vawng lo chuan thiam loh chantîrtu pakhat a nei a ni; ka thusawi kha, khami thu ngei khân ni kin nîah chuan amah chu thiam loh a la chantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Keima phuah chawpin ka sawi si lo; Pa mi tîrtu chuan ka sawi tûr leh ka hril tûr hi thu mi pe zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ama thupêk chu chatuana nunna a ni tih ka hria; chuvâng chuan thu ka sawi hi, Pa mi hrilh ang zêlin ka sawi a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Kalhlên Kût hmain Isuan he khawvêl hi chhuahsana, Pa hnêna a kal hun a thleng tawh tih a hria a, ama mi, khawvêla awm a hmangaih ṭhinte chu, a tâwp thleng pawhin a hmangaih reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, zanriah ei laiin (chumi hma pawhin Diabolan Simona fapa Iskariot Juda chu, Isua mantîr a rilrûktîr a),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isuan, Pain a kutah thil engkim a vawntîr te, Pathian hnên aṭanga lo chhuak a nih te, Pathian hnêna a kal dâwn te hre reng chungin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a zanriah kîl lai chu a tho va, a puante a dah a, inhrûkna puan a la a, a veng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, maihûnah tui a bun a, zirtîrte ke a sil ta a, inhrûkna puan a ven chuan a hru zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, Simon Petera hnênah a lo kal a. Ani chuan, “Lalpa, nang êmin ka ke i sil dâwn em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Ka thiltih hi tûnah i hre lo; nimahsela, nakinah i la hria ang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Peteran a hnênah, “Ka ke i sil tawp lo vang,” a ti a. Isuan a hnênah, “Ka sil loh che chuan ka hnênah eng mah chan i nei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Simon Peteran a hnênah, “Lalpa, chuti a nih chuan ka ke chauh ni lovin, ka kut leh ka lû pawh le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Inbual tawh chu a ke lo chu sil a ngai lo, a fai var alâwm; nangni in fai e, in za erawh chuan a ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />(A mantîrtu tûr chu a hre si a; chuvângin, “In za chuan in fai lo,” a ti a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutianga an ke a sila, a puante a lâka, a ṭhut leh hnu chuan an hnênah, “In chunga ka thiltih hi eng tihna nge ni in hria em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangnin Zirtîrtu leh Lalpa min ti ṭhîn; in tidik e, ka ni ngei rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei Lalpa leh Zirtîrtu mahin in ke ka sil chuan, nangni pawhin in ke in insilsak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In chunga ka tih ang hian nangni pawhin in tih vena tûrin ka tihhmuh che u a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, bâwih a pu aiin a ropui lo; tirhkoh pawh a tîrtu aiin a ropui hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng thil chu in hriat chuan ti ula in eng a thâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“In zaa thu ka sawi lo ve; ka thlante chu ka hria; nimahsela, chu chu, ‘Ka chhang eituin a keartui ka chungah a lek ta,’ tih Pathian Lehkha Thu kha a lo thlen theihna tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tûnah a lo thlen hmain ka hrilh che u hi, a lo thlen hunah kei hi amah kha ka ni tih in rin theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh ka tirh apiang lâwm chu, keimah mi lâwm a ni; tu pawh kei mi lâwm chu mi tîrtu lâwm a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isuan chutianga a sawi zawh chuan a rilruin a mangang a, “Tihtak meuhin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, in zînga mi pakhatin mi mantîr ang,” tiin a hriattîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrte chuan a tih bîk an hre lo va, an inen hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte zînga mi pakhat, Isuan a hmangaiha chu, dawhkân sîrah Isua ângchhûngah bawkin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Simon Peteran chu mi hnênah chuan, “Tu thu ber nge a sawi, mi hrilh teh,” tiin a zaizir a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, ani chu a awmna ngaiah a awm a, Isua âwm nghêngin a lo thle phei a, a hnênah, “Lalpa, tu ber nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Chhang them ka chiahsaka, ka pêka chu a ni ang,” a ti a, a chhâng a. Chutichuan, chhang them chu a chiah hnuin a la a, Iskariot Simona fapa Juda hnênah chuan a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, chhang them chu a pêk hnu chuan a chhûngah Setana a lût ta nghâl a. Chutichuan, Isuan a hnênah, “I tih tûr chu ti thuai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />(Tin, dawhkân sîra mite chuan tu mân engtiziaa ti nge a nih an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ṭhenkhatin, Juda chuan tangka ip a vawn avângin, Isuan, “Kût atân thil kan châkkhai apiang lei rawh,” a ti emaw, “Mi retheite hnênah englo pêk tûr,” a ti emaw an ti a ni.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan chhang them chu a la a, a chhuak ta nghâl a; chumi lai chu zân a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, a chhuah hnuin Isuan a sawi a, “Tûnah chuan Mihring Fapa chawimawiin a awm ta, amah avângin Pathian pawh chawimawiin a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pathianin amahah chuan ani chu a chawimawi ang, a chawimawi nghâl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Naute u, rei lo tê in hnênah ka la awm rih e. Nangnin mi zawng ang; tin, Juda-te hnênah, ‘Ka kalna tûrah in lo kal thei lo vang,’ tih ka sawi ang khân, tûnah chuti bawkin in hnênah ka sawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thupêk thar ka pêk che u hi, inhmangaih ula; keiin ka hmangaih che u ang hian nangni pawh inhmangaih ula.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />In inhmangaih chuan mi zawng zawngin ka zirtîrte in ni tih chumiah chuan an hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Simon Peteran a hnênah, “Lalpa, khawiah nge i kal dâwn?” a ti a. Isuan, “Ka kalna tûrah nangin tûnah mi zui thei lo vang; nakinah erawh chuan mi zui ang,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Peteran a hnênah, “Lalpa, engati nge tûnah pawh ka zui theih loh vang che? Nangmah avângin ka nun ka paih ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Isuan, “Keimah avângin i nun i paih ang maw? Tihtak meuhin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che, nangin vawi thum mi phat hma loh chuan âr a khuang lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In thinlung mangang suh se; Pathian in ring e, kei pawh mi ring ve rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pa inah awmna tam tak a awm a, a awm loh chuan ka hrilh tawh tûr che u a ni; in tân hmun siamin ka kal dâwn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, in tân hmun ka han siam chuan, ka lo kîr leh ang a, ka hnênah ka la ang che u; ka awmnaah nangni pawh in awm theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka kalna tûr a kawng chin in hria e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thoman a hnênah, “Lalpa, i kalna tûr chin kan hre lo asin; a kawng engtin nge kan hriat ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Keimah hi kawng leh thutak leh nunna ka ni; keimaha kal lo chu tu mah Pa hnênah an thleng ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei mi hria ni ula, ka Pa pawh in hre tawh tûr; tûn achinah amah in hria e, amah in hmu tawh bawk,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Philipan a hnênah, “Lalpa, Pa chu keini min hmuhtîr ta che; chutichuan, kan tân a tâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Philip, hei leh chen hi in hnênah ka awm a, chuti pawhin mi hre lo maw? Tu pawh mi hmu chu Pa hmu a ni. ‘Pa chu keini min hmuhtîr rawh,’ eng ti tiha ti nge i nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei Paa ka awm leh Pa keimahah a awm tih i âwih lo vem ni? In hnêna thu ka sawi hi keima phuah chawpin ka sawi lo; Pa keimahah a awm reng a, a thil a ti zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei Paa ka awm leh Pa keimahah a awm tih mi ring rawh u; a nih loh leh, thiltih avâng tal hian mi ring rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, tu pawh mi ring chuan thil ka tihte hi a ti ve ang; hêng aia thil ropui zâwk pawh hi a la ti ang, Pa hnênah ka kal dâwn avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ka hmingin eng pawh in dîl apiang chu ka ti zêl ang, Pa chu Fapa avânga chawimawia a awm theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangnin ka hmingin eng pawh mi dîl chuan, chu chu ka ti zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangnin mi hmangaih chuan ka thupêkte chu in zâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Pa ka dîl ang a, ani chuan Thlamuantu dang a pe ang che u, chatuana in hnêna awm tûrin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />chu chu Thlarau dik tak a ni; khawvêlin chumi chu an nei thei lo, amah an hmuh lohva an hriat hek loh avângin; nangnin ani chu in hria e, in hnênah a awm reng si a, nangmahniah chuan a awm dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Fahrahin ka kalsan lo vang che u; in hnênah ka lo kal leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rei lo deuh chinah khawvêlin mi hmu leh tawh lo vang; nimahsela, nangni zawngin mi hmu ang; keimah ka nun avângin nangni pawh in nung ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan kei ka Paa ka awm te, nangni keimaha in awm te, kei nangmahnia ka awm te in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu pawh ka thupêkte neia zâwm chu mi hmangaihtu a ni; tu pawh mi hmangaih chu ka Pain a hmangaih ang, kei pawhin ani chu ka hmangaih ang a, a hnênah ka inlâr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Juda (Iskariota lo zâwk) chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa, keini hnênah i inlâr ang a, khawvêl hnêna i inlâr si lo tûr chu, engati nge?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Miin mi hmangaih chuan ka thu a zâwm ang a; ka Pain ani chu a hmangaih ang a, a hnênah kan lo kal ang a, a hnênah kan awm reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu pawh mi hmangaih lo chuan ka thu a zâwm lo; thu in hriatte hi ka ta a ni lo, Pa mi tîrtu ta a ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In hnêna ka la awm chhûng hian hêng thu hi ka hrilh che u hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Thlamuantu, Thlarau Thianghlim, Pain ka hminga a rawn tirh tûr khân, chu mi chuan engkim a zirtîr ang che u a, in hnêna ka sawi zawng zawng a hriat chhuahtîr leh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thlamuanna ka hnutchhiah a che u; keima thlamuanna ka pe a che u; khawvêlin a pêk angin ka pêk loh che u hi. In thinlung mangang suh se, hlauh pawh hlau suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />‘Ka kal bo dâwn a, in hnênah ka lo kal leh ang,’ ka tihzia che u kha in hre tawh e. Nangnin mi hmangaih ni ulang, Pa hnêna ka kal dâwn avângin in lâwm tûr a ni; Pa chu keimah aiin a ropui zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tûnah a lo thlen hma hian ka hrilh tawh che u hi, a lo thlen huna in rin nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />In hnênah thu ka sawi leh tawh mang lo vang, khawvêl lal a lo kal dâwn si a, ani chuan keimahah eng mah rêng a nei lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />nimahsela, keiin Pa ka hmangaih leh, Pain thu mi pêk ang zêlin thil ka ti tih, khawvêlin an hriatna tûr a nih hi. Tho rawh u, heta ta hi i chhuak ang u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei grêp hrui tak tak ka ni, ka Pa a huan enkawltu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka zawmpui pêng rah lo apiang a paih ṭhîn a; a rah apiang a tithianghlim ṭhîn, a rah tam lehzual nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In hnêna ka thusawi avâng chuan tûnah pawh in thianghlim tawh pang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keimahah awm reng rawh u, kei pawh nangmahniah ka awm reng ang. Pêng chu grêp hruia a awm reng loh chuan amahin a rah thei lo ang bawkin, nangni pawh keimaha in awm reng loh chuan in rah thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei grêp hrui chu ka ni, nangni a pêngte chu in ni; tu pawh keimaha awm renga, kei pawh amaha ka awm rengna chu, chu mi chu tam takin a rah ṭhîn; keimah lovin eng mah in ti thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi keimaha a awm reng loh chuan, pêng anga paih chhuahin a awm a, a vuai ṭhîn; tin, an fawm a, meiah an paih a, a kâng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangni keimaha in awm renga, ka thu nangmahnia a awm reng bawk chuan, in duh apiang dîl rawh u, in tân tihin a awm zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hemi avângin ka Pa chu chawimawiin a awm ṭhîn, tam taka in rah hian; chutichuan, ka zirtîrte in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pain mi hmangaih ang bawkin kei pawhin ka hmangaih che u hi; ka hmangaihin awm reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangnin ka thupêkte in zawm chuan, ka hmangaihin in awm reng ang; keiin ka Pa thupêkte ka zâwm a, a hmangaihin ka awm reng ang bawk hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka lâwm nangmahnia a awm reng nân leh, in lâwm a kim nân hêng thu hi in hnênah ka sawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hei hi ka thupêk a ni, keiin ka hmangaih che u ang bawkin nangni inhmangaih ula.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihringin a ṭhian aia a nun a paih aliama hmangaihna nasa zâwk tu mân an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thu ka pêk apiang che u in tih chuan ka ṭhiante in ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bâwih ka ti leh tawh lo vang che u; a pu thiltih bâwihin a hre si lo; ṭhiante ka ti tawh zâwk ang che u; Pa hnêna thil ka hriat zawng zawng in hnênah ka puang tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangnin mi thlang lo, keiman ka thlang zâwk che u a, va rah tûr leh in rah awm reng tûrin ka ruat bawk a che u; ka hminga Pa hnêna in dîl apiang a pêkna tûr che uin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In inhmangaih theih nân hêng thu hi ka pe a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khawvêlin a huat che u chuan, a huat hma che u pawhin keimah mi hua tih in hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangni khawvêla mi ni ula, khawvêlin amaha mi a hmangaih tûr; khawvêla mi in ni si lo va, khawvêla mi ka thlan chhuah zâwk che u avâng hian khawvêlin a hua che u a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Bâwih a pu aiin a ropui lo,’ tih thu ka hrilh tawh che u kha hre reng rawh u. Annin kei mi tihduhdah tawh chuan nangni pawh an tiduhdah ang che u; ka thu an zawm tawh chuan nangni thu pawh an zâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, hêng thil zawng zawng hi ka hming avângin in chungah an ti ang, mi tîrtu an hriat loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei lo kalin an hnênah thu sawi suh ila, sual an nei lo tûr; tûnah erawh zawng an sual chhuanlam tûr an nei ta lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu pawh kei mi hua chuan ka Pa pawh a hua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thil, mi dang tu ma tih ngai lohte an zîngah ti suh ila, sual an nei lo tûr; tûnah erawh zawng annin kei leh ka Pa, kan pahnihin min hmu tawh a, huat pawh min haw tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eng pawh ni rawh se, an Dân Lehkhabua, ‘Annin enga khaw lawilovin mi hua,’ tih thuziak kha a lo thlenna tûrin an ti a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Pa hnên ata Thlamuantu in hnêna ka tirh tûr, Paa chhuak Thlarau dik tak chu a lo thlen hunah, ani chuan ka thu a hriattîr ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />nangni pawhin in hriattîr bawk ang, a tîr ata ka hnêna in awm avângin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tihlungnihlohva in awm lohna tûrin hêng hi in hnênah ka sawi tawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Inkhâwmna inahte an hnawntîr ang che u a; a ni, tu pawh a tihlum tûr che u apiangin Pathian chungah thil ṭha tiin an inhria ang, chutiang hun chu a thleng dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chûng thil chu an ti ang, Pa leh kei min hriat loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng thu hi in hnênah ka sawi tawh hi, a hun a lo thlen hunah ka hrilh tawh che u tih in hriat lehna tûrin. Hêng thil hi a tîr ata ka la hrilh lo rêng che u a ni, in hnêna ka la awm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tûnah erawh zawng mi tîrtu hnênah ka kal dâwn a ni; nangniho zînga tu mân, ‘Khawiah nge i kal dâwn?’ tiin mi zâwt si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hêng thu hi in hnêna ka sawi avângin, in thinlung chu lungngaiin a khat thlu hial ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, thu dik tak ka hrilh a che u; ka kal in tân a ṭha e; ka kal loh chuan Thlamuantu chu in hnênah a lo kal dâwn si lo; ka kal erawh chuan in hnênah ka rawn tîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chu a lo thlen chuan sual thûah te, fel thûah te, rorêl thûah te khawvêl an thiam loh a hriattîr ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />sual thûah te thiam loh an chang ang, kei mi rin loh avâng hian;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />fel thûah te thiam loh an chang ang, Pa hnênah ka kal dâwn a, nangnin mi hmuh leh dâwn tawh loh avâng hian;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />rorêl thûah te thiam loh an chang ang, he khawvêl lal hi thiam loh va a tlûk tawh avâng hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In hnênah thu sawi tûr tam tak ka la nei cheu va; nimahsela, tûnah zawng in tlin rih lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, amah, Thlarau dik tak chu a lo thlen hun chuan, thutak zawng zawngah chuan a hruai lût ang che u: ama phuah chawpin thu a sawi dâwn si lo; thu a dawn apiang chu a hril zâwk ang; thil lo thleng tûrte pawh a hriattîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ani chuan kei mi chawimawi ang; ka taa mi a la ang a, in hnênah a hriattîr dâwn si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pain thil a neih zawng zawng ka ta a ni; chuvângin, ‘Ka taa mi a la ang a, in hnênah a hriattîr ang che u,’ ka tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rei lo teah nangnin kei mi hmu lo vang a; rei lo teah bawk nangnin kei mi hmu leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a zirtîrte ṭhenkhatin, “Kan hnêna a thusawi hi eng nge ni, ‘Rei lo teah nangnin kei mi hmu lo vang a, rei lo teah bawk nangnin kei mi hmu leh ang,’ a tih leh, ‘Pa hnêna ka kal dâwn avângin,’ a tih hi?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, anmahni vêk chuan, “Hei, ‘Rei lo te’ a tih hi eng tihna nge ni? A thusawi hi a ngaihna kan hre lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, amah zawh an duh tih Isuan a hria a, an hnênah, “ ‘Rei lo teah nangnin kei mi hmu lo vang a, rei lo teah bawk nangnin kei mi hmu leh ang,’ tia ka thusawi hi in inzâwt maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, nangni in mittui a tla ang a, in ṭap vak bawk ang a, khawvêl erawh chu an lâwm ang; nangni in lungngai ang a; nimahsela, in lungngaih chu lâwmah a chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hmeichhiain nau a veiin a lungngai ṭhîn, a hun a thlen tawh avângin; nimahsela, nau a hrin veleh a thlaphân chu a hre leh tawh ṭhîn lo, khawvêla mihring lo piang chu a lawm avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, tûnah nangni in lungngai e; nimahsela, ka hmu leh ang che u a, in thinlung a lâwm ang a, in lâwm chu tu mân an lâksak lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan nangnin eng mah kei mi zâwt lo vang. Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che u, Pa hnênah eng pawh in dîl chuan, keima hmingin a pe ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tûn thlengin ka hmingin eng mah in la dîl lo; dîl rawh u; tichuan, in hmu ang, in lâwm a kimna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chûng thu chu a thawiin in hnênah ka sawi tawh; a hun a thleng dâwn, chumi hunah chuan in hnênah a thawiin ka sawi leh tawh lo vang a, fiah takin Pa chanchin ka hrilh zâwk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan keima hmingin thil in dîl ang; ‘Pa hnênah keiin ka ngensak ang che u,’ ka ti lo a che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pa ngeiin a hmangaih si che u a, nangnin kei mi hmangaiha, Paa chhuak ka ni tih mi rin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kei Pa hnên ata lo chhuaka, khawvêla lo kal ka ni; khawvêl kalsana Pa hnêna hâwng leh tûr ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, zirtîrten, “Ngai teh, tûnah zawng fiah takin thu i sawi a, a thawi rêng rêngin i sawi tâk loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangin engkim i hria a, tu ma zawh che i ngai lo tih tûnah kan hre ta; hemi avâng hian Pathian hnên ata lo chhuak i ni tih kan âwih e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a chhâng a, an hnênah, “Tûnah chuan in âwih ta maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, a hun a thleng dâwn, a ni, a thleng tawh mêk, chumi hunah chuan mahni in ṭheuhvah in darh vek ang a, keimah chauhvin mi thlahthlam ang; nimahsela, Pa ka hnênah a awm avângin mahni chauhvin ka awm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hêng thu hi in hnênah ka sawi tawh hi, keimahah hian in thlamuanna tûrin. Khawvêlah hian hrehawmin in awm ṭhîn; nimahsela, thlamuang takin awm rawh u, keiin khawvêl ka ngam ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng thu chu Isuan a sawi a; tin, vanvadâkin, “Ka Pa, a hun a thleng ta; i Fapa chawimawi rawh, Fapain a chawimawi nân che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />khatia mi zawng zawng chunga thuneia i siam khân, a hnêna i pêk apiangte chu chatuana nunna a pêk theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hei hi chatuana nunna a ni, nang Pathian tak chauh leh i tirh Isua Krista hriat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangin thil tih tûr mi pêk kha ka ti zo va, khawvêlah ka chawimawi tawh a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw ka Pa, khawvêl awm hmaa i hnêna mawina ka neih khân, tûnah nangma hnên ngeiah mi chawimawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangin khawvêl zînga chhuak mite kei mi pêk hnênah khân i hming ka tilang ta; anni chu i ta an nih kha, nangin anni chu kei mi pe a ni; anni chuan i thu an zâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangin thil kei mi pêk apiang, i hnên aṭanga chhuak a ni tih tûnah an hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangin thu mi pêkte kha an hnênah ka pe tawh si a; chûng chu an vawng a, i hnên aṭanga chhuak ka ni tih dik takin an hre ta a, nangin mi tîr tih pawh an âwih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An tân ka ngensak hi; khawvêl tâna ngensak ka ni lo, nangin mi pêkteho tân zâwk a ni; i ta an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil zawng zawng ka ta apiang i ta a ni e, i ta chu ka ta a ni e; anmahni avângin chawimawiin ka awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, kei zawng khawvêlah ka awm tawh lo vang, hêngho erawh hi chu khawvêlah an awm ang, kei i hnênah ka lo haw dâwn ta. Ka Pa thianghlim, nangin kei mi pêkteho hi i hmingin hum rawh, pumkhat an nih theih nân, keimahni ang bawk hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An hnêna ka awm chhûng khân nangin kei mi pêkteho hi i hmingin ka hum ṭhîn; anni chu ka vêng a, an zîngah pakhat mah an boral lo, boral fapa lo kha chu; Lehkha Thu kha a lo thlenna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, tûnah i hnênah ka lo haw dâwn ta; khawvêlah hêng thu hi ka sawi a ni, ka lâwm anmahnia an neih kimna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I thu an hnênah ka pe ta e; tin, khawvêlin anni chu an hua a, khawvêla mi an nih loh avângin, kei khawvêla mi ka ni lo ang bawk hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangin anni chu khawvêl ata i lâk chhuah tûra ngên ka ni lo va, mi sual lakah chuan i hum tûr ka ti zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anni chu khawvêla mi an ni lo, kei khawvêla mi ka ni lo ang bawk hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Anni chu thutakin tithianghlim rawh, i thu chu thutak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangin khawvêla kei mi tîr ang khân, kei pawhin anni chu khawvêlah ka tirh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anmahni avângin ka intithianghlim a ni, anni pawh thutaka an thianghlimna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hênghote tân chauh hian ngensak ka ni lo, an thu avânga kei mi la ring tûrte tân pawh ngensak ka ni bawk e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />an zaa pumkhat an nihna tûrin; ka Pa, nang keimaha i awm leh, kei nangmaha ka awm ang bawk hian, anni pawh keimahnia an awmna tûrin; nangin kei mi tîr tih khawvêlin an âwih theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, nangin ropuina mi pêk kha keiin anmahni ka pe ta; anni chu pumkhat an nihna tûrin, keini pumkhat kan ni ang bawk hian;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />kei anmahniah, nang keimahah, anni pumkhata an awma, an famkim theihna tûrin; nangin kei mi tîr tih leh, mi hmangaih angin anni hi i hmangaih tih, khawvêlin an hriat theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka Pa, nangin kei mi pêkte hi ka awmnaa ka hnêna awmah ka duh; nangin mi pêk ka ropuina kha an hmuhna tûrin; leilung pian hma pawhin nangin mi hmangaih tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aw ka Pa fel tak, khawvêl zawngin an hre lo chia, kei erawh chuan ka hriat che kha; hêngho pawh hian nangin kei mi tîr tih an hriat kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah i hming ka hriattîr a, ka hriattîr leh fo vang; nangin kei mi hmangaihna kha anmahniah a awma, kei pawh anmahniah ka awm theihna tûrin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isuan chûng thu chu a sawi zawhin a zirtîrte nên an chhuak a, Kidron luikawr an kân a; chutah chuan huan a awm a, chumiah chuan an lût a, amah leh a zirtîrte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a mantîrtu Juda pawh chuan chumi hmun chu a hria; Isua chu a zirtîrte hnênah chutah chuan a lêng fo si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda chuan sipai pâwl nên, puithiam lalte leh Pharisaite hnêna awm tiangkengtute nên a hruai a, khâwnvârte, meichherte, hriamte kengin chutah chuan an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isuan a chunga thil thleng tûr zawng zawng chu a hre reng a, a va chhuak a, an hnênah, “Tu nge in zawn?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “Nazareth Isua,” an ti a, an chhâng a. Isuan an hnênah, “Keimah hi ka ni,” a ti a. Tin, a mantîrtu Juda pawh chu an zîngah a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, “Keimah hi ka ni,” a tih veleh an hnungtawlh a, leiah an tlu hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Tu nge in zawn?” a ti a, a zâwt leh a. Tin, anni chuan, “Nazareth Isua,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Isuan, “Keimah hi ka ni tih ka hrilh che u alâwm; nangnin kei mi zawng in nih chuan hêngho hi thlah ṭha rawh u,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />(A thusawi, “Nangin kei mi pêkteho pakhat mah ka hloh ral lo,” a tih kha a thlen nân.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Simon Peteran khandaih a vawng a, a phawi a, puithiam lalber bâwih a sât a, a beng ding lam a sah thlâksak a. (Bawih hming chu Malka a ni a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isuan Petera hnênah, “Khandaih kha a paiah khung rawh; Pain no mi pêk hi ka in lo vang em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, sipai pâwl nên, an hotu lalber nên, Juda-te tiangkengtute nên chuan Isua an man a, an phuar a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ana hnênah an hruai hmasa a, Kaiapha puzawn a nih avângin. Kaiapha chu, chumi kum chuan puithiam lalber a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kaiapha chu, “Mi zawng zawng aia mi pakhat thih a ṭha,” tia Juda-te rawtpuitu kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Simon Petera chuan Isua a zui a, zirtîr dang pakhat nên. Chu zirtîr chu puithiam lalber hmêlhriat a ni a, puithiam lalber in hual chhûng kawtlaiah Isua hnênah a lût ve a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />nimahsela, Petera chu pâwnah kawngkhâr bulah a ding reng a. Chutichuan, zirtîr dang, puithiam lalber hmêlhriata chu a va chhuak a, kawngkhâr vêngtu chu a bia a, Petera chu a hruai lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, kawngkhâr vêngtu nula chuan Petera hnênah, “Nang pawh he mi zirtîrte zînga tel ve i ni em?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Ka ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, bâwihte leh tiangkengtute chu chutah chuan an ding hlawm a, a vawh avângin meihawlin mei an chhêm a, a lum an ai a; Petera pawh an hnênah a tel a, ding chungin mei lum a ai ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalber chuan Isua chu a zirtîrte chanchin leh a thu zirtîr a zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Isuan a chhâng a, a hnênah, “Khawvêl hnênah vântlâng hriatin thu ka sawi ṭhin kha; inkhâwmna in leh Pathian biak in, Juda zawng zawng awm khâwmnaahte chuan ka zirtîr fo ṭhin kha, a rûkin eng mah ka sawi lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Engati nge kei mi zawh? An hnêna ka thusawizia chu ka thu hretute zâwt rawh; ngai rawh, chûng chuan ka thusawi chu an hria alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chu chu a sawi veleh a kianga ding tiang kengtu pakhatin Isua chu a bêng a, “Puithiam lalber heti hian i chhâng maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Thu sual sawi ka nih chuan ka sualna mi hriattîr rawh; nimahsela, thu ṭha ka sawi pawhin engah nge mi ben?” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Ana chuan phuar chungin puithiam lalber Kaiapha hnênah a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Simon Petera chuan dingin mei lum a ai a. Tin, “Nang pawh a zirtîr zînga tel ve i ni em?” an ti a. Ani chuan, “Ka ni lo,” tiin a pha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalber bâwih pakhat, Petera beng sah thlâka laichîn chuan, “A hnênah huanah khân ka hmu lo che em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, Petera chu a pha leh a; tin, âr a khuang ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu Kaiapha in aṭang chuan lal inah an hruai leh a; zîng a ni a; tin, anni zawng lal inah an lût lo, an luh zawngin an bawlhhlawh ang a, Kalhlên Kût chaw an ei thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, Pilata chu an hnênah a va chhuak a, an hnênah, “He mi chungah hian thupawi eng nge in neih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Anni chuan a hnênah, “He mi hi mi sual ni suh sela i hnênah kan rawn hruai lo vang,” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Pilata chuan an hnênah, “Nangnin hruai ulangin, in dân angin a thu rêl rawh u,” a ti a. Juda-te chuan a hnênah, “Keini thuin mi tu mah tihhlum dân a awm lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />(A thih tûr thu Isuan a sawi anga a thlen nân.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pilata chu a inah a lût leh a, Isua a ko va, a hnênah, “Juda-te lal i ni em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Isuan, “Hei hi nangma rilru puak chhuaka i sawi nge, mi dangin an hrilh che, ka chungchâng thu hi?” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pilatan, “Kei Juda ka ni em ni? Nangma chite leh puithiam lalten ka hnênah an rawn hruai che a nih hi; thil eng nge i tih?” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Isuan, “Ka ram chu he khawvêla mi hi a ni lo; ka ram chu he khawvêla mi hi ni sela, ka ṭhuihruaiten an bei ang, Juda-te hnêna pêka ka awm loh nân; nimahsela, ka ram zawng heta mi hi a ni lo,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Pilatan a hnênah, “Chu! lal i ni elo?” a ti a. Isuan, “Ni e, lal ka ni asin. Thutak hriattîr hi ka pian chhan leh khawvêla ka rawn kal chhan a ni. Tu pawh thutaka mi apiangin ka thu an pawm ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pilatan a hnênah, “Thutak eng nge ni?” a ti a. Tin, chu thu chu a sawi zawh veleh Juda-te hnênah a va chhuak leh a, an hnênah, “Eng mah a sualna ka hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nimahsela, Kalhlên Kûtah mi pakhat ka chhuahsakna tûr che u dân in nei; chutichuan, Juda-te lal hi chhuahsak che u ila in duh em?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, anni chu an au leh a, “He mi hi chu ni suh se, Barabba kha ni zâwk rawh se,” an ti a. Barabba chu suamhmang a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chutih lai chuan Pilatan Isua chu a hruai a, a vua a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, sipaite chuan hlînglukhum an phiar a, an khumtîr a, puan sen duk an sintîr bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tin, a kiangah an lo kal a, “Chibai! Juda-te Lal!” an ti a, an bêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Pilata chu a chhuak leh a, an hnênah, “En teh u, eng mah a sualna ka hmu lo tih in hriat nân, in hnênah ka rawn hruai chhuah hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Isua chu hlînglukhum khum leh puan sen duk sin chungin a lo chhuak a. Tin, Pilatan an hnênah, “En teh u, mihringa hi!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lalte leh tiangkengtute chuan amah an hmuh veleh an au va, “Kraws-ah khêngbet rawh, kraws-ah khêngbet rawh,” an ti a. Pilatan an hnênah, “Nangnin kalpui ula, kraws-ah khêngbet rawh u; kei zawngin eng mah a sualna ka hmu si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda-te chuan a hnênah, “Kan dân kawng khat a awm, chumi dân ang zêlin Pathian Fapaa a insiam avângin a thi tûr a ni,” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Pilatan chu thu chu a hriatin a hlau lehzual a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a inah a lût leh a, Isua hnênah, “Khawi lama mi nge i nih?” a ti a. Nimahsela, Isuan a chhâng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Pilatan a hnênah, “Nangin kei mi be lo vei maw? Thlah thei che ka ni, kraws-a khêngbet thei che ka ni tih i hre lo vem ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isuan, “Chung lam aṭanga pêk i nih loh chuan, ka chungah hian tih theih rêng rêng i nei lo vang; chuvângin, i hnêna mi petu khân sual a phur zual a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi achin chu Pilatan thlah a tum a; nimahsela, Juda-te chu an au va, “He mi hi i thlah chuan Kaisara ṭhian i ni lo vang; tu pawh lala insiam apiang Kaisara do an ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Pilatan chûng thu chu a hriat veleh Isua chu a hruai chhuak a, a hming Lungrem - Hebrai ṭawng erawh chuan Gabbatha an ti, chumi hmunah chuan rorêlna ṭhutphahah a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />(Tin, chumi ni chu Kalhlên Kût Inrinni a ni a, tûkṭhuan ei hun lai a ni.) Tin, ani chuan Juda-te hnênah, “En teh u, in Lal hi!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, anni chu an au va, “Tiboral rawh, tiboral rawh, kraws-ah khêngbet rawh,” an ti a. Pilatan an hnênah, “In Lal hi kraws-ah ka khêngbet ang maw?” a ti a. Puithiam lalte chuan, “Kaisara lo chu lal dang kan nei lo,” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pilata chuan kraws-a khenbeh tûrin amah chu an hnênah a pe ta a. Chutichuan, Isua chu an hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan mahni tâna kraws puin, ‘Lu ruh hmun’ an tih, Hebrai ṭawnga Golgotha an tih chu, chumi hmun thleng chuan a va chhuak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />chutah chuan kraws-ah an khêngbet a, mi dang pahnih nên, a sîr tuakah pakhat ve vein, a laiah Isua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Pilatan lehkha a ziak a, kraws lêr lamah a bel a. “Nazareth Isua - Juda-te Lal” tiin ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, chu lehkha chu Juda-te a ṭhen tam takin an chhiar a; Isua kraws-a an khenbehna hmun chu khawpui kiang a ni a; Hebrai ṭawng te, Rom ṭawng te, Grik ṭawng tein ziak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda-te puithiam lalte chuan Pilata hnênah, “ ‘Juda-te Lal’ tiin ziak suh; ‘Juda-te Lal ka ni a ti,’ tiin ziak zâwk rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilatan, “Ka ziak kha ka ziak zo tawh,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, sipaiten Isua chu kraws-a an khenbeh zawh chuan a silhfênte an la a, phel liah an siam a, sipaiten phel khatin an chang ṭheuh va; a kawr an la bawk a. Kawr chu ṭhui loh kawr a ni a, a nghâwng ata a pumin tah vek a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />chuvângin, anni chuan, “I pawt thlêr suh ang u, tu ta ber tûr nge ṭhum i vâwr zâwk ang u,” an ti a. (Pathian Lehkha Thu, “Ka silhfênte an insem a, Ka kawr atân ṭhum an vâwr a,” tih a thlenna tûrin.) Chûng thil chu sipaiten an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Isua kraws kiangah a nu leh a nu laizâwn, Mari, Klopa nupui leh Mari Magdalini an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a nu leh a zirtîr a hmangaih kha a kianga ding a hmu a, a nu hnênah, “Hmeichhia, en teh, i fapa kha!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, zirtîr hnênah chuan, “En teh, i nu kha!” a ti a. Tin, chuta chin chu, chu zirtîr chuan ama inah ani chu a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Isuan thil engkim tûnah a kim tawh tih a hria a, Pathian Lehkha Thu kha a thlen nân, “Ka tui a hâl e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutah chuan bêl pakhat uain thûra khat an hûng a; chutichuan, sponj pakhat chu uain thûra chiah khatin, husop tiangah an târ a, a hmuiah an han thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Isuan uain thûr chu a lo in zawh chuan, “A kin ta,” a ti a. Tin, a lû a kûn a, a thlarau a thlah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Inrinni a nih avângin ruangte chu Chawlhnia kraws-a a awm reng loh nân, (chu Chawlhni chu ni ropui a ni si a) Juda-ten Pilata hnênah an kete tihtliaha an ruang kalpuiah an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, sipaite chu an lo kal a, a hnêna kraws-a an khenbeh mi tawn tirh leh mi pakhat chu an kete an titliak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />nimahsela, Isua kiangah an lo kal a, a thi tawh reng tih an hria a, a kete an titliak ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nimahsela sipaite zînga mi pakhatin a nâkah feiin a chhun a; tichuan, thisen leh tui a lo chhuak ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A hmutu chuan a hriattîr tawh, (a thu hriattîr a dik a ni; a sawi dik tih a inhria) nangni pawhin in rinna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pathian Lehkha Thu, “A ruh pakhat mah tihtliah a ni lo vang,” tih thlenna tûrin chûng thil chu a lo awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Pathian Lehkha Thu dangin, “An chhuna chu an la en ang,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, chumi hnuah chuan Josefa, Arimathai khuaa mi, Isua zirtîr, nimahsela, Juda-te a hlauh avânga a rûka awm chuan Isua ruang chu kalpui atân Pilata hnênah a dîl a; tin, Pilatan a phal a. Chutichuan, a lo kal a, a ruang chu a kalpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, Nikodema, a tîra zâna a hnêna lo kal kha, murra leh aloe inpawlh sa bûk sawmnga lai kengin a lo kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, Isua ruang chu an la a, Juda-te inphûm dân angin englo rimtuite nên chuan puan zai sînin an tuam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tin, kraws-a an khenbehna hmunah chuan huan pakhat a awm a; huanah chuan tu mah la zalh ngai lohna thlân thar pakhat a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, Juda-te Inrinni a nih avângin, thlân chu an kiang lawk a ni si a, chutah chuan Isua chu an zalh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ni sarih ni hmasa berah, zîngah, khua a la thim laiin, Mari Magdalini chu thlânah chuan a va kal a, lung chu thlân ata lâk sawnin a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, a tlân a, Simon Petera leh zirtîr dang, Isuan a hmangaiha hnênah chuan a lo kal a, an hnênah, “Thlân ata kha Lalpa chu an kal bopui ta, an dahna chin ka hre si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Petera chu a chhuak a, zirtîr dang nên chuan; tin, thlân lam an pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, an tlân dûn a; zirtîr dang chuan Petera chu a tlân khalh a, thlân chu a thleng hmasa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a kûn a, a bih a, puan zai sînte chu awm rengin a hmu a; nimahsela, a chhûngah a lût lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Simon Petera pawhin a hnungah a rawn ûm thleng a, thlân chhûngah a lût a; puan zai sînte chu awm reng leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a lua inhrûkna puan awm chu, puan zai sinte zînga awm lovin, zial sain hmun hranga awm a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, zirtîr dang, thlân thleng hmasaa pawh chu a lût ve a, a hmu a, a âwih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mitthi zîng ata a tho leh tur a ni tih Pathian Lehkha Thu kha an la hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, zirtîrte chu anmahni inah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, Mari chu pâwnah thlân kiangah ṭap chungin a ding a; tichuan, ṭap chungin a kûn a, thlân chhûng chu a bih a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tin, vântirhkoh pahnih puan vâr sinin, Isua ruang zalhna hmunah chuan, pakhat a lû lamah, pakhat a ke lamah ṭhu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Hmeichhia, engati nge i ṭah?” an ti a. Ani chuan an hnênah, “Ka Lalpa an kal bopui a, an dahna chin ka hriat loh avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, chutia a sawi veleh a hnung lam a hawi a, Isua ding a hmu a, Isua a ni tih a hre si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Hmeichhia, engati nge i ṭah? Tu nge i zawn?” a ti a. Ani chuan huan enkawltu emaw a ti a, a hnênah, “Ka pu, amah heta ta i kalpui a nih chuan i dahna chin mi hrilh ang che; chutichuan, ka la ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Mari,” a ti a. Ani chu a hawi a, a hnênah Hebrai ṭawngin, “Rabboni,” a ti a (chu chu Zirtîrtu tihna a ni a).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Isuan a hnênah, “Mi vuan suh; tûn thleng pawhin Pa hnênah ka la lâwn chho lo a ni; amaherawhchu, ka unaute hnênah va kal la, an hnênah, ‘Ka Pa, in Pa, ka Pathian, in Pathian hnênah ka lâwn chho dâwn, a ti e,’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mari Magdalini chu a va kal a, zirtîrte hnênah, “Lalpa chu ka hmu ta,” a ti a, a hnêna thu a sawiziate pawh chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni, ni sarih ni hmasa berah, khua a lo tlai lamin, Juda-te hlauh avânga zirtîrte awmna kawngkhârte chu an khâr hnu chuan, an zîngah Isua a lo ding a, an hnênah, “In chungah thlamuanna awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, chu chu a sawi zawh chuan a kut leh a nâk an hnênah a entîr a. Tin, Lalpa chu an hmuh chuan zirtîrte chu an lâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “In chungah thlamuanna awm rawh se; Pain kei mi tîr ang bawkin ka tirh che u hi,” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, chûng thu chu a sawi zawhin an chungah a thaw a, an hnênah “Thlarau Thianghlim nei rawh u; tu sual pawh in ngaihdam apiang ngaihdam a ni ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tu sual pawh in ngaihdam loh apiang ngaihdam loh a ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Isua a lo kal lai khân sâwm leh pahnihte zînga tel ve Thoma, Phîra an tih chu, an hnênah a awm ve lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutichuan, zirtîr dangte chuan a hnênah, “Lalpa chu kan hmu ta,” an ti a. Nimahsela, ani chuan an hnênah, “A kuta thîr khenna serte kha ka hmuha, thîr khenna serahte chuan ka kutzung ka khawih luha, a nâka ka zen meuh loh chuan ka ring lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, ni riat hnuah a zirtîrte chu in chhûngah an awm leh a, Thoma pawh an hnênah a awm ve a. Tin, Isua a lo kal a, kawngte chu khâr a ni si a, an zîngah a lo ding ta a, an hnênah, “In chungah thlamuanna awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, Thoma hnênah chuan, “I kutzungin han khawih la, ka kutte en rawh; i kut han ban la, ka nâkah zen rawh; ring lovin awm suh la, ring rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thoman a hnênah, “Ka Lalpa leh ka Pathian i ni,” a ti a, a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Nang chuan mi hmuh avângin i ring a ni; hmu lova ring apiangte chu an eng a thâwl e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Isuan zirtîrte hmaah chuan chhinchhiahna dang tam tak a ti ṭeuh va, chûng chu he lehkhabuah hian ziak a ni lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />nimahsela, hêng hi Isua chu Krista, Pathian Fapa a ni tih in rinna tûr leh, in rina, a hminga nun in neihna tûrin ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Tiberia dîlah Isua chu a zirtîrte hnênah a inlâr leh a; heti hian a inlâr:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Simon Petera te, Thoma (Phîra an tih) te, Galili rama Kana khuaa mi Nathanaela te, Zebedaia fapa pahnihte leh a zirtîr dang pahnihte an awm khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Simon Petera chuan an hnênah, “Sangha manin ka kal dâwn e,” a ti a. Anni chuan a hnênah, “Keini pawh i hnênah kan kal ve ang,” an ti a. Tin, an kal chhuak a, lawngah an chuang a; chumi zân chuan eng mah an man lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, khawfîng chahin Isua chu ṭiauphovah a lo ding a; nimahsela, zirtîrte chuan Isua a ni tih an hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Naute u, ei tûr engilo in nei em?” a ti a. Anni chuan a hnênah, “Nei lo,” an ti a, an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Lawng sîr ding lamah khân lên dêng ulang, in hmu ang,” a ti a. Tin, an dêng a, sangha tam avângin an hnûk chhuak zo ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, zirtîr Isuan a hmangaiha khân, Petera hnênah, “Lalpa a nih saw,” a ti a. Chutichuan, Lalpa a ni tih Simon Peteran a hriat veleh a kawr a veng a (saruaka awm a ni si a), dîlah a zuang thla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, zirtîr dangte chuan lawng tê tak tê chuan lên, sangha chawpa hnûk chungin an rawn pan a (khawmual aṭangin an hla si lo va, tawng zahnih emaw lek a ni a).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, khawmuala an chhuah veleh, chutah chuan meihawla mei chhêm an hmu a, a chunga sangha leh chhangpêr rawh nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Tûnah in sangha man kha a ṭhen han la rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Simon Petera chu a va chuang a, lên chu sangha lian pui puia khatin khawmualah a hnûk chhuak a, za leh sawmnga leh pathum a ni; chuti zozai chu awm mah sela, lên chu a ṭet si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Isuan an hnênah, “Tûkṭhuan lo ei rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, zirtîrte zînga tu mahin a hnênah, “Tu nge i nih?” tiin an zâwt ngam lo, Lalpa a ni tih an hre reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Isua a lo kal a, chhangpêr chu a la a, an hnênah a pe a, sanghate pawh chu chutiangin a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chu chu Isua mitthi zîng ata a thawhleh hnua a zirtîrte hnêna a inlâr vawi thumna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, tûkṭhuan an ei zawhin, Isuan Simon Petera hnênah chuan, “Simon, Johana fapa, hêngte ai hian nangin kei mi hmangaih zâwk em?” a ti a. Ani chuan a hnênah, “Aw, Lalpa; ka ngaina che tih i hria e,” a ti a. Ani chuan a hnênah, “Ka berâmnote châwm rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a vawi hnihnaah a hnênah, “Simon, Johana fapa, nangin kei mi hmangaih em?” a ti leh a. Ani chuan a hnênah, “Aw, Lalpa; ka ngaina che tih i hria e,” a ti leh a. Ani chuan a hnênah, “Ka berâmte enkawl rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, a vawi thumnaah chuan a hnênah, “Simon, Johana fapa, nangin kei mi ngaina em?” a ti a. Tin, a vawi thumnaah, “Nangin mi ngaina em?” a hnêna a tih avâng chuan Petera chu a lungngai a, a hnênah, “Lalpa, engkim i hria a, ka ngaina che tih i hria e,” a ti a. Isuan a hnênah, “Ka berâmte châwm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tihtak meuhvin, tihtak meuhvin ka hrilh a che, i naupan lai khân i taiah i inhrêng a, i duhna apiangah i kal ṭhîn a; nimahsela, i upat hunah chuan i kutte i phar ang a, mi dangin an hrênsak ang chia, i duh lohna lamah an kai ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />(Chûng thu chu engtianga thiin nge Pathian a la chawimawi ang tih hriattîr nân a sawi a ni.) Tin, chu chu a sawi zawhin a hnênah, “Mi zui rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Petera chu a hawi a, Isuan zirtîr a hmangaih, zanriah ei laia a âwm nghênga lo thle pheia, “A mantîrtu tûr che chu tu ber nge ni?” titua khân a rawn zui a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Peteran ani chu a hmu a, Isua hnênah, “Lalpa, he mi hian eng nge a tih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Isuan a hnênah, “Ka lo kal leh thlenga awm rengah phei duh ila, chu chu enga i hman tûr nge ni? Nangin mi zui mai rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, chu zirtîr chu thi lo tûrin a thu chu unaute zîngah chuan a thang ta a; nimahsela, Isuan a thi lo vang tih a hnênah a sawi si lo, “Ka lo kal leh thlenga awm rengah phei duh ila, chu chu enga i hman tûr nge ni?” a ti mai a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chu zirtîr chu hêng thu hriattîrtu leh ziaktu hi a ni; a thu hriattîr hi dik tak a ni tih kan hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, hêng lo hi Isua thiltih a dang tam tak a la awm, chûng chu ziak fai vek ni dâwn sela, lehkhabu ziak tûr zawng zawng chu khawvêlah pawh hian lengin ka ring lo.
  </para>
</usx>
